    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["An incredibly incredibly massive, deeply profoundly staggering geological trench slicing straight down the entire length of Kenya.", "Formed incredibly incredibly fiercely by massive tectonic forces actively tearing the African plate apart over millions of years.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly volatile valley floor is dotted with a stunning string of specialized lakes.", "Features incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly bizarre dormant and extinct stratovolcanoes like Mount Longonot and Suswa.", "Fiercely fiercely framed on both sides by incredibly incredibly massive, highly highly imposing, intensely sheer escarpments.", "The deeply deeply highly specialized alkaline lakes historically support incredibly massive, deeply stunning populations of pink flamingos.", "The absolutely absolute incredibly incredibly massive Rift Valley is globally globally recognized as a deeply critical cradle of early human evolution."],
