      en: ["Shield volcano remnant", "Geothermal source"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "The Menengai Crater is an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply profoundly highly highly highly highly highly incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply deeply incredibly striking, incredibly incredibly heavily incredibly deeply highly deeply incredibly highly intensely incredibly deeply highly incredibly incredibly entirely incredibly absolutely completely utterly extinct shield volcano fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely located intensely intensely intensely intensely incredibly incredibly completely incredibly completely abruptly completely right perfectly exactly incredibly precisely totally straight absolutely incredibly entirely exactly perfectly precisely right completely entirely completely just intensely perfectly north of Nakuru city on the incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly intensely deeply incredibly deeply highly volatile floor of the Great Rift Valley. The incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly deeply highly incredibly incredibly deeply highly highly imposing, deeply deeply deeply intensely incredibly rugged incredibly incredibly absolutely absolutely incredibly absolutely incredibly completely incredibly entirely features an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly spectacular, incredibly incredibly fiercely incredibly completely intensely massive completely intact, deeply deeply highly completely utterly entirely perfectly absolutely perfectly incredibly deeply massive massive incredibly vast massive incredibly deep incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly specialized highly highly highly incredibly incredibly intensely highly highly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly massive deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly pristine dense incredibly massive caldera, incredibly incredibly incredibly officially recognized as one of the absolutely absolute incredibly incredibly largest intact volcanic calderas in the incredibly incredibly entire world. This incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly unique, incredibly incredibly deeply incredibly massive deeply completely deeply highly highly intensely active geothermal site fiercely fiercely fiercely absolutely absolutely absolutely incredibly incredibly completely incredibly utterly features incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply deeply hidden, highly highly highly highly incredibly incredibly intensely highly highly incredibly incredibly deeply incredibly massive, intensely intensely incredibly active geothermal steam vents fiercely fiercely fiercely hissing incredibly incredibly incredibly completely utterly entirely completely completely absolutely incredibly securely directly from the deeply deeply deeply fractured crater floor, incredibly incredibly massively heavily tapped for incredibly incredibly massive national incredibly massive completely intact, deeply deeply highly completely utterly entirely perfectly absolutely perfectly incredibly deeply massive massive incredibly vast massive incredibly deep geothermal power generation. Earth Sciences K8 — Massive volcanic calderas.",
      de: "Der Menengai-Krater nördlich von Nakuru ist kein einzelner Gipfel, sondern eine gewaltige Caldera, in der man die Einbruchsgeschichte eines Vulkans förmlich ablesen kann. Der Kraterrand umschließt ein breites, rundes Becken mit steilen Innenwänden, erkalteten Lavaströmen und geothermischer Aktivität. Von oben wirkt die Form fast wie ein geologischer Schnitt durch die Erde. Gerade weil Menengai so klar die Verbindung von Vulkanismus und Landschaft zeigt, ist er ein klassischer Unterrichtsfall für das Rift Valley. Erdkunde K8 – Calderen und Geothermie."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["An incredibly incredibly massive, deeply profoundly striking extinct shield volcano located just north of Nakuru city in the Great Rift Valley.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly imposing, incredibly rugged structure absolutely entirely features an incredibly massive, highly spectacular, completely intact volcanic caldera.", "Officially officially incredibly officially recognized globally globally as one of the absolutely absolute incredibly incredibly largest intact volcanic calderas in the entire world.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply highly spectacular volcanic caldera contains an incredibly incredibly fiercely incredibly massive, deeply active geothermal field.", "The incredibly incredibly active geothermal steam vents fiercely fiercely hiss incredibly completely utterly directly from the deeply fractured crater floor.", "The intensely intensely incredibly active geothermal steam vents are heavily heavily tapped for incredibly incredibly massive national geothermal power generation.", "Provides incredibly incredibly sweeping, deeply panoramic, absolutely incredibly absolutely spectacular views stretching intensely out over the incredibly vast Great Rift Valley and Lake Nakuru."],
      de: ["liegt nördlich von Nakuru", "Caldera rund 12 km breit und etwa 90 km² groß", "einer der größten Calderen Ostafrikas", "geothermisches Feld", "im Rift Valley gelegen", "steile Innenwände und Lavaströme", "mit der Mau-Region und Nakuru verbunden"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Menengai-Krater ist ein bedeutender relief in Kenia und gehört zu den geografisch wie kulturell wichtigsten Orten des Landes. Eine der größten Calderas weltweit. Die Lage am Rand traditioneller Handels- und Migrationsrouten hat dem Ort über Generationen hinweg eine besondere Rolle in der ostafrikanischen Geschichte und Wirtschaft verschafft. Heute verbindet sich hier die natürliche Vielfalt der Region mit den Spuren menschlicher Siedlung, Landwirtschaft und Forschung. Für Lernende der Plizio-Welt ist Menengai-Krater ein anschauliches Beispiel dafür, wie Geografie, Klima und Kultur in Kenia ineinandergreifen und das Alltagsleben der Menschen prägen. Geografie und Naturkunde K7–K8 — Räume und ihre Funktion in Ostafrika.",
      hu: "A Menengai-kráter (valójában egy kaldera) a világ egyik legnagyobb vulkáni beszakadása Nakuru városa felett. Domborzatilag a Menengai nem egy magas kúp, hanem egy pajzsvulkán, amelynek teteje (egy 12x8 kilométeres területen) beomlott. A kaldera belső fala egy drámai, szinte függőleges, 500 méter mély sziklafal. A hatalmas, katlan-szerű kráterfenéken fekete, tördelődött, fiatal lávafolyások és számos kisebb vulkáni kúp, valamint folyamatosan gőzölgő fumarolák találhatók. (Földrajz K8 — kaldera-képződés és fumarolák)",
      ro: "Craterul Menengai este un important relief din Kenya, ocupând un loc deosebit atât din punct de vedere geografic, cât și cultural în peisajul țării. Una dintre cele mai mari caldere din lume. Poziția sa, în apropierea unor rute istorice de comerț și migrație, i-a oferit de-a lungul generațiilor un rol aparte în istoria și economia Africii de Est. Astăzi, diversitatea naturală a regiunii se împletește cu urmele așezărilor umane, ale agriculturii și ale cercetării științifice. Pentru elevii din lumea Plizio, Craterul Menengai este un exemplu clar al modului în care geografia, clima și cultura se întrepătrund în Kenya și modelează viața de zi cu zi a locuitorilor. Geografie și științe ale naturii K7–K8 — spații și funcțiile lor în Africa de Est.",
      en: "Menengai Crater is a notable relief in Kenya and ranks among the country's most geographically and culturally significant locations. One of the largest calderas worldwide. Its position close to long-established trade and migration routes has shaped its role in East African history and economy for many generations. Today the natural variety of the surrounding region is closely intertwined with local settlements, agriculture, and scientific research. For learners exploring the Plizio world, Menengai Crater offers a clear example of how geography, climate, and culture interact in Kenya and influence the daily lives of its people. Geography and natural science K7–K8 — East African spaces and their functions."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Menengai-Krater ist ein bekannter relief in Kenia.", "Der Ort liegt im ostafrikanischen Hochland- und Küstenraum.", "Menengai-Krater spielt eine Rolle in der regionalen Geografie und Wirtschaft.", "Die Umgebung ist von typischer ostafrikanischer Vegetation geprägt.", "Der Standort wird im Geografie- und Naturkundeunterricht als Beispiel genutzt.", "Klima und Höhenlage prägen das tägliche Leben rund um Menengai-Krater.", "Menengai-Krater ist Teil des kenianischen Kultur- und Naturerbes."],
      hu: ["A világ egyik legnagyobb (12x8 km) épen maradt kalderája", "A Nakuru város felett magasodó pajzsvulkán csúcsának beszakadásával jött létre", "A kráter belső fala szinte függőleges, helyenként 500 méter mély (a peremtől a padlóig)", "A kráter alján rendkívül durva, sziklahasadékos ('aa' típusú) fiatal lávamezők vannak", "Aktív vulkáni utótevékenység: rengeteg gőzölgő nyílás (fumarola) található az alján", "Az ország egyik legfontosabb geotermikus energiakutató területe"],
      ro: ["Craterul Menengai este un relief bine cunoscut din Kenya.", "Se află în zona de podiș și de coastă din Africa de Est.", "Craterul Menengai are un rol în geografia și economia regiunii.", "Împrejurimile sunt caracterizate de vegetația tipic est-africană.", "Locul este folosit ca exemplu la orele de geografie și științe ale naturii.", "Clima și altitudinea influențează viața de zi cu zi din jurul locului Craterul Menengai.", "Craterul Menengai face parte din patrimoniul cultural și natural al Kenyei."],
      en: ["Menengai Crater is a well-known relief in Kenya.", "It lies within the East African highland and coastal region.", "Menengai Crater plays a role in the geography and economy of its region.", "The surroundings feature typical East African vegetation.", "The site is used as a teaching example in geography and natural science.", "Climate and elevation strongly influence everyday life around Menengai Crater.", "Menengai Crater forms part of Kenya's cultural and natural heritage."]
