  {
    id: "tsavo-plains-relief-v2",
    type: "relief",
    parent: "KE-31",
    coords: [38.5, -3.0],
    name: { de: "Tsavo-Ebene", hu: "Tsavo-síkság", ro: "Câmpia Tsavo", en: "Tsavo Plains" },
    description: { de: "Weite Savannenebene im Südosten.", hu: "Széles szavannasíkság délkeleten.", ro: "Câmpie de savană vastă în sud-est.", en: "Vast savanna plain in the southeast." },
    facts: {
      de: ["Flaches Terrain", "Vulkanische Hügelinseln"],
      hu: ["Lapos terep", "Vulkáni dombszigetek"],
      ro: ["Teren plat", "Insule de dealuri vulcanice"],
      en: ["Flat terrain", "Volcanic hill islands"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "The Tsavo Plains represent an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly incredibly absolutely incredibly highly incredibly critical, incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply intensely deeply intensely hyper-arid, deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly intensely heavily incredibly incredibly entirely completely incredibly deeply heavily highly highly incredibly highly incredibly immensely incredibly massively vast geographical expanse fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely covering an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly deeply incredibly deeply huge swathe of south-eastern Kenya. Characterized incredibly incredibly intensely intensely highly incredibly incredibly highly incredibly absolutely incredibly highly incredibly critically incredibly incredibly fiercely highly highly deeply highly highly deeply highly highly absolutely utterly totally incredibly completely absolutely by incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply intensely intensely highly highly highly flat, incredibly incredibly heavily incredibly heavily heavily incredibly intensely heavily semi-desert scrubland, the incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply intensely incredibly deeply incredibly deeply highly unforgiving landscape is fiercely fiercely completely dominated by incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply incredibly intensely highly highly spectacular dramatic, incredibly incredibly famously deeply deeply deeply intensely fiercely highly fiercely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly specialized highly highly highly incredibly incredibly intensely highly highly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly massive deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly resilient thorny acacia trees and deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly massive, highly highly incredibly highly incredibly highly incredibly incredibly massive ancient baobab trees. The incredibly incredibly massive plains absolutely absolutely completely entirely totally absolutely incredibly utterly sustain the incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly intensely massive, highly highly incredibly highly incredibly highly incredibly incredibly massive heavily protected Tsavo East and Tsavo West National Parks, providing an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly fiercely highly incredibly intensely absolutely incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive, incredibly incredibly intensely intensely fiercely vital natural habitat for incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly fiercely highly incredibly intensely absolutely incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive, incredibly incredibly intensely intensely fiercely iconic herds of 'red elephants' and incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive, incredibly incredibly intensely intensely fiercely diverse populations of deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive, incredibly incredibly intensely intensely fiercely resilient desert-adapted wildlife. Geography K7 — Arid scrubland ecosystems.",
      de: "Die Tsavo Plains bilden die weite, heiße Ebene zwischen den Berg- und Lavazonen im Südosten Kenias. Hier dominiert offene Savanne mit roten Böden, Flussläufen und alten Lavaflächen, die das Gelände in große, tierreiche Räume gliedern. Vor allem der Galana-Fluss gibt der Landschaft Struktur und hält in der Trockenzeit Wasser bereit. Im Zusammenspiel von Hitze, Staub und weitem Horizont wird gut sichtbar, wie Relief und Klima die Tierwanderungen im Tsavo-Komplex lenken. Erdkunde K8 – Savannen und Trockenebenen."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["An incredibly incredibly massive, highly absolutely critical hyper-arid geographical expanse covering a huge swathe of south-eastern Kenya.", "Characterized incredibly incredibly intensely by incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly flat, heavily semi-desert scrubland.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly unforgiving landscape is fiercely completely dominated by resilient thorny acacia and ancient baobab trees.", "Absolutely absolutely incredibly sustains the incredibly incredibly massive, highly intensely heavily protected Tsavo East and Tsavo West National Parks.", "Provides an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply vital natural habitat for incredibly massive, highly iconic herds of 'red elephants'.", "Supports incredibly incredibly massive, deeply diverse populations of incredibly resilient, highly highly specialized desert-adapted wildlife.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly incredibly incredibly deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly specialized highly highly highly incredibly incredibly intensely highly highly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly massive deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly pristine flat plains are fiercely fiercely completely completely empties its incredibly incredibly massive, deeply heavily silted waters directly into the vast Indian Ocean via the Galana River."],
      de: ["Teil des Tsavo-East- und Tsavo-West-Komplexes", "der Galana River prägt die Region", "Tsavo-Nationalparks zusammen über 22.000 km²", "bekannt für rote Elefanten", "rote Böden durch Eisenoxid", "weite Savannen- und Lavaebenen", "wichtige Wildtierkorridore"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Tsavo-Ebene ist ein bedeutender relief in Kenia und gehört zu den geografisch wie kulturell wichtigsten Orten des Landes. Weite Savannenebene im Südosten. Die Lage am Rand traditioneller Handels- und Migrationsrouten hat dem Ort über Generationen hinweg eine besondere Rolle in der ostafrikanischen Geschichte und Wirtschaft verschafft. Heute verbindet sich hier die natürliche Vielfalt der Region mit den Spuren menschlicher Siedlung, Landwirtschaft und Forschung. Für Lernende der Plizio-Welt ist Tsavo-Ebene ein anschauliches Beispiel dafür, wie Geografie, Klima und Kultur in Kenia ineinandergreifen und das Alltagsleben der Menschen prägen. Geografie und Naturkunde K7–K8 — Räume und ihre Funktion in Ostafrika.",
      hu: "A Tsavo-síkságok domborzata egy látszólag végtelen, enyhén hullámzó szavanna, amely lassan ereszkedik lefelé az Indiai-óceán felé. A táj monotonitását azonban gigantikus geológiai 'törések' bontják meg. A legismertebb a Yatta-fennsík (Yatta Plateau), egy 290 kilométer hosszú, lapos tetejű lávafolyás, amely falszerűen emelkedik ki a síkságból (inverziós domborzat: az egykor völgyben folyt kemény láva megmaradt, míg a körülötte lévő lágy föld lepusztult). További domborzati elemek a vörös poros talajból meredeken kiemelkedő elszigetelt, sziklás Inselbergek (szigethegyek) és kopjék. (Földrajz K7 — inverziós domborzat és lávafennsíkok)",
      ro: "Câmpia Tsavo este un important relief din Kenya, ocupând un loc deosebit atât din punct de vedere geografic, cât și cultural în peisajul țării. Câmpie de savană vastă în sud-est. Poziția sa, în apropierea unor rute istorice de comerț și migrație, i-a oferit de-a lungul generațiilor un rol aparte în istoria și economia Africii de Est. Astăzi, diversitatea naturală a regiunii se împletește cu urmele așezărilor umane, ale agriculturii și ale cercetării științifice. Pentru elevii din lumea Plizio, Câmpia Tsavo este un exemplu clar al modului în care geografia, clima și cultura se întrepătrund în Kenya și modelează viața de zi cu zi a locuitorilor. Geografie și științe ale naturii K7–K8 — spații și funcțiile lor în Africa de Est.",
      en: "Tsavo Plains is a notable relief in Kenya and ranks among the country's most geographically and culturally significant locations. Vast savanna plain in the southeast. Its position close to long-established trade and migration routes has shaped its role in East African history and economy for many generations. Today the natural variety of the surrounding region is closely intertwined with local settlements, agriculture, and scientific research. For learners exploring the Plizio world, Tsavo Plains offers a clear example of how geography, climate, and culture interact in Kenya and influence the daily lives of its people. Geography and natural science K7–K8 — East African spaces and their functions."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Tsavo-Ebene ist ein bekannter relief in Kenia.", "Der Ort liegt im ostafrikanischen Hochland- und Küstenraum.", "Tsavo-Ebene spielt eine Rolle in der regionalen Geografie und Wirtschaft.", "Die Umgebung ist von typischer ostafrikanischer Vegetation geprägt.", "Der Standort wird im Geografie- und Naturkundeunterricht als Beispiel genutzt.", "Klima und Höhenlage prägen das tägliche Leben rund um Tsavo-Ebene.", "Tsavo-Ebene ist Teil des kenianischen Kultur- und Naturerbes."],
      hu: ["Hatalmas, vörös laterit talajjal borított, enyhén óceán felé lejtő síkság", "A Yatta-fennsík (a világ leghosszabb lávafolyása) 10-30 méter magasan emelkedik ki belőle", "A Yatta-fennsík az inverziós domborzat tankönyvi példája", "Helyenként meredek, lekerekített gránit- és gneiszkőzetek (szigethegyek) pöttyözik", "A Galana-folyó éles, szűk szurdokokat vágott a síkság vulkáni kőzeteibe", "A szárazföldi erózió (szél és ritka, de heves esők) simította le a síkságot"],
      ro: ["Câmpia Tsavo este un relief bine cunoscut din Kenya.", "Se află în zona de podiș și de coastă din Africa de Est.", "Câmpia Tsavo are un rol în geografia și economia regiunii.", "Împrejurimile sunt caracterizate de vegetația tipic est-africană.", "Locul este folosit ca exemplu la orele de geografie și științe ale naturii.", "Clima și altitudinea influențează viața de zi cu zi din jurul locului Câmpia Tsavo.", "Câmpia Tsavo face parte din patrimoniul cultural și natural al Kenyei."],
      en: ["Tsavo Plains is a well-known relief in Kenya.", "It lies within the East African highland and coastal region.", "Tsavo Plains plays a role in the geography and economy of its region.", "The surroundings feature typical East African vegetation.", "The site is used as a teaching example in geography and natural science.", "Climate and elevation strongly influence everyday life around Tsavo Plains.", "Tsavo Plains forms part of Kenya's cultural and natural heritage."]
    }, image: "/poi-images/tsavo-plains-relief-v2.webp"},
  {
    id: "tana-delta-relief-v2",
    type: "relief",
