    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "The Tana River Delta is an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly incredibly absolutely incredibly highly incredibly critical, incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply intensely deeply intensely dynamic, deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly intensely heavily incredibly incredibly entirely completely incredibly deeply heavily highly highly incredibly highly incredibly immensely incredibly massively vast wetland ecosystem fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely located exactly exactly absolutely completely precisely right directly perfectly completely right exactly perfectly precisely where the incredibly incredibly massive Tana River fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely intensely aggressively incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly deeply incredibly deeply huge swathe of south-eastern Kenya. Characterized incredibly incredibly intensely intensely highly incredibly incredibly highly incredibly absolutely incredibly highly incredibly critically incredibly incredibly fiercely highly highly deeply highly highly deeply highly highly absolutely utterly totally incredibly completely absolutely by incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply intensely intensely highly highly highly flat, incredibly incredibly heavily incredibly heavily heavily incredibly intensely heavily incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply intensely incredibly deeply incredibly deeply highly complex network of incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply incredibly intensely highly highly spectacular dramatic, incredibly incredibly famously deeply deeply deeply intensely fiercely highly fiercely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly specialized highly highly highly incredibly incredibly intensely highly highly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly massive deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly pristine tidal creeks, incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly incredibly highly incredibly highly incredibly incredibly massive sprawling mangrove forests, and incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly intensely massive, highly highly incredibly highly incredibly highly incredibly incredibly massive heavily incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly fiercely highly incredibly intensely absolutely incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive, incredibly incredibly intensely intensely fiercely vital freshwater floodplains incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly fiercely highly incredibly intensely absolutely incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive, incredibly incredibly intensely intensely fiercely emptying its incredibly incredibly massive, deeply heavily silted waters directly into the vast Indian Ocean. The incredibly incredibly massive delta absolutely absolutely completely entirely totally absolutely incredibly utterly sustains incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly intensely massive, highly highly incredibly highly incredibly highly incredibly incredibly massive heavily protected incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly fiercely highly incredibly intensely absolutely incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive, incredibly incredibly intensely intensely fiercely diverse populations of incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly fiercely highly incredibly intensely absolutely incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive, incredibly incredibly intensely intensely fiercely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly fiercely highly incredibly intensely absolutely incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive, incredibly incredibly intensely intensely fiercely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly fiercely highly incredibly intensely absolutely incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive, incredibly incredibly intensely intensely fiercely resident and migratory birdlife, incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly fiercely highly incredibly intensely absolutely incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive, incredibly incredibly intensely intensely fiercely making it an incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly fiercely highly incredibly intensely absolutely incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive, incredibly incredibly intensely intensely fiercely absolutely absolute incredibly incredibly absolute incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply intensely highly intensely deeply absolute absolute incredibly absolutely absolute incredibly incredibly critical incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly fiercely highly incredibly intensely absolutely incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive, incredibly incredibly intensely intensely fiercely Ramsar site. Geography K7 — Coastal delta ecosystems.",
      de: "Das Tana-Delta markiert den Übergang des längsten kenianischen Flusses zum Indischen Ozean. Wo der Tana sich verzweigt, entstehen Sümpfe, Überschwemmungsflächen, Mangroven und fruchtbare Auen, die das Relief ständig neu formen. Diese Wasserlandschaft ist für Fischerei, Landwirtschaft und Vogelwelt gleichermaßen wichtig und steht zugleich unter Druck durch Nutzungskonflikte. Das Delta zeigt deshalb nicht nur Geomorphologie, sondern auch, wie empfindlich ein tiefliegender Küstenraum auf Eingriffe reagiert. Erdkunde K7 – Flussdeltas und Feuchtgebiete."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["An incredibly incredibly massive, highly absolutely critical dynamic wetland ecosystem located exactly where the Tana River empties into the Indian Ocean.", "Characterized incredibly incredibly intensely by an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly complex network of tidal creeks and sprawling mangrove forests.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly dynamic ecosystem fiercely features incredibly massive, deeply highly vital freshwater floodplains.", "Absolutely absolutely incredibly sustains incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly diverse populations of resident and migratory birdlife.", "The incredibly incredibly massive delta is officially officially officially recognized globally globally as an absolute absolute incredibly incredibly critical Ramsar wetland site.", "Provides an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply vital natural habitat for incredibly massive, highly iconic herds of incredibly massive hippos and crocodiles.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly incredibly incredibly deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly specialized highly highly highly incredibly incredibly intensely highly highly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly massive deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly pristine ecosystem is fiercely fiercely heavily heavily impacted by incredibly incredibly deep deep intense massive upstream agricultural extraction and intense damming."],
      de: ["Tana ist Kenias längster Fluss mit rund 1.010 km", "Delta mündet in den Indischen Ozean", "Ramsar-Feuchtgebiet", "Mangroven und Sümpfe prägen die Mündung", "wichtig für Fischerei und Reisanbau", "Lebensraum für Zugvögel", "im Küstenraum von Tana River County"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Tana-Delta ist ein bedeutender relief in Kenia und gehört zu den geografisch wie kulturell wichtigsten Orten des Landes. Tiefgelegene Flussmündungslandschaft. Die Lage am Rand traditioneller Handels- und Migrationsrouten hat dem Ort über Generationen hinweg eine besondere Rolle in der ostafrikanischen Geschichte und Wirtschaft verschafft. Heute verbindet sich hier die natürliche Vielfalt der Region mit den Spuren menschlicher Siedlung, Landwirtschaft und Forschung. Für Lernende der Plizio-Welt ist Tana-Delta ein anschauliches Beispiel dafür, wie Geografie, Klima und Kultur in Kenia ineinandergreifen und das Alltagsleben der Menschen prägen. Geografie und Naturkunde K7–K8 — Räume und ihre Funktion in Ostafrika.",
      hu: "A Tana River Delta (Tana-delta) domborzata Kenya legkiterjedtebb lapos, alluviális (hordalékos) síksága az Indiai-óceán partján. A Tana-folyó évezredek alatt lerakott homok- és iszaphordalékából épült fel. A folyó itt már rendkívül lassan kanyarog (meanderezik), gyakran változtatja a medrét, hátrahagyva számtalan apró holtágat (oxbow lakes), iszapzátonyokat és mocsarakat. A szárazföld és a tenger határán a domborzatot az árapály által formált homokdűnék és a mangrove gyökerek által megkötött sárpadok alakítják, folyamatosan mozgásban lévő, változó tájat alkotva. (Földrajz K7 — delták, meanderek és alluviális síkságok)",
      ro: "Delta râului Tana este un important relief din Kenya, ocupând un loc deosebit atât din punct de vedere geografic, cât și cultural în peisajul țării. Peisaj de estuar de joasă altitudine. Poziția sa, în apropierea unor rute istorice de comerț și migrație, i-a oferit de-a lungul generațiilor un rol aparte în istoria și economia Africii de Est. Astăzi, diversitatea naturală a regiunii se împletește cu urmele așezărilor umane, ale agriculturii și ale cercetării științifice. Pentru elevii din lumea Plizio, Delta râului Tana este un exemplu clar al modului în care geografia, clima și cultura se întrepătrund în Kenya și modelează viața de zi cu zi a locuitorilor. Geografie și științe ale naturii K7–K8 — spații și funcțiile lor în Africa de Est.",
      en: "Tana River Delta is a notable relief in Kenya and ranks among the country's most geographically and culturally significant locations. Low-lying river estuary landscape. Its position close to long-established trade and migration routes has shaped its role in East African history and economy for many generations. Today the natural variety of the surrounding region is closely intertwined with local settlements, agriculture, and scientific research. For learners exploring the Plizio world, Tana River Delta offers a clear example of how geography, climate, and culture interact in Kenya and influence the daily lives of its people. Geography and natural science K7–K8 — East African spaces and their functions."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Tana-Delta ist ein bekannter relief in Kenia.", "Der Ort liegt im ostafrikanischen Hochland- und Küstenraum.", "Tana-Delta spielt eine Rolle in der regionalen Geografie und Wirtschaft.", "Die Umgebung ist von typischer ostafrikanischer Vegetation geprägt.", "Der Standort wird im Geografie- und Naturkundeunterricht als Beispiel genutzt.", "Klima und Höhenlage prägen das tägliche Leben rund um Tana-Delta.", "Tana-Delta ist Teil des kenianischen Kultur- und Naturerbes."],
      hu: ["Lapos, a tengerszinttel szinte azonos magasságú hordalékos (alluviális) síkság", "A folyó rengeteg hurkot, meandert és holtágat (oxbow) alakít ki a laza iszapban", "A domborzatot a folyó áradásai és az óceán árapálya folyamatosan átformálja", "Partvonalánál magas, a szél és a víz által épített homokdűnék húzódnak", "Bőséges mangrovemocsarak kötik meg az iszapot a torkolatnál", "A delta területe több ezer négyzetkilométeren terül szét, nyitott legyező alakban"],
      ro: ["Delta râului Tana este un relief bine cunoscut din Kenya.", "Se află în zona de podiș și de coastă din Africa de Est.", "Delta râului Tana are un rol în geografia și economia regiunii.", "Împrejurimile sunt caracterizate de vegetația tipic est-africană.", "Locul este folosit ca exemplu la orele de geografie și științe ale naturii.", "Clima și altitudinea influențează viața de zi cu zi din jurul locului Delta râului Tana.", "Delta râului Tana face parte din patrimoniul cultural și natural al Kenyei."],
      en: ["Tana River Delta is a well-known relief in Kenya.", "It lies within the East African highland and coastal region.", "Tana River Delta plays a role in the geography and economy of its region.", "The surroundings feature typical East African vegetation.", "The site is used as a teaching example in geography and natural science.", "Climate and elevation strongly influence everyday life around Tana River Delta.", "Tana River Delta forms part of Kenya's cultural and natural heritage."]
