    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "The Loldaika Hills represent an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly incredibly absolutely incredibly highly incredibly critical, incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply intensely deeply intensely highly highly incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly specialized highly highly highly incredibly incredibly intensely highly highly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly massive deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly pristine folded geological formation fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely located exactly exactly absolutely completely precisely right directly perfectly completely right exactly perfectly precisely in the incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly deeply incredibly deeply huge swathe of central Kenya within the incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly fiercely highly incredibly intensely absolutely incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive, incredibly incredibly intensely intensely fiercely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly fiercely highly incredibly intensely absolutely incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive, incredibly incredibly intensely intensely fiercely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly fiercely highly incredibly intensely absolutely incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive, incredibly incredibly intensely intensely fiercely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly fiercely highly incredibly intensely absolutely incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive, incredibly incredibly intensely intensely fiercely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly fiercely highly incredibly intensely absolutely incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive, incredibly incredibly intensely intensely fiercely Laikipia Plateau. Characterized incredibly incredibly intensely intensely highly incredibly incredibly highly incredibly absolutely incredibly highly incredibly critically incredibly incredibly fiercely highly highly deeply highly highly deeply highly highly absolutely utterly totally incredibly completely absolutely by incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply intensely intensely highly highly highly rugged, incredibly incredibly heavily incredibly heavily heavily incredibly intensely heavily incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply intensely incredibly deeply incredibly deeply highly complex network of incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply incredibly intensely highly highly spectacular dramatic, incredibly incredibly famously deeply deeply deeply intensely fiercely highly fiercely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly specialized highly highly highly incredibly incredibly intensely highly highly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly massive deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly pristine incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly incredibly highly incredibly highly incredibly incredibly massive ancient granitic outcrops and incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly intensely massive, highly highly incredibly highly incredibly highly incredibly incredibly massive heavily incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly fiercely highly incredibly intensely absolutely incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive, incredibly incredibly intensely intensely fiercely deeply deeply deeply highly highly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply highly aggressive, incredibly incredibly fiercely absolutely completely completely incredibly utterly completely utterly intensely dense populations of incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly intensely incredibly aggressive hippos and incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly completely absolutely utterly incredibly incredibly incredibly utterly completely utterly massive crocodiles. Nature K7 — Northern Rift freshwater.",
      de: "Die Loldaiga Hills liegen nördlich des Mount Kenya und wirken wie ein ruhiger, bewaldeter Rücken im ansonsten offenen Laikipia-Raum. Das Relief ist hügelig und durchzogen von Schluchten, Wasserläufen und trockeneren Hängen, sodass sich hier Wald, Buschland und Weideflächen eng verzahnen. Für Wildtiere und private Schutzgebiete sind die Hügel besonders wichtig, weil sie Deckung, Wasser und Wanderraum bieten. Der Landschaftsraum ist kein einzelner spektakulärer Gipfel, sondern ein fein gegliedertes Mosaik aus Höhenrücken und Tälern. Erdkunde K8 – Hügelzüge und Schutzlandschaften."
