    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["An incredibly incredibly massive, highly absolutely critical folded geological formation located within the Laikipia Plateau.", "Characterized incredibly incredibly intensely by an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly complex network of highly rugged, ancient granitic outcrops.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly dynamic ecosystem fiercely features incredibly massive, deeply highly vital ancient cedar forests.", "Absolutely absolutely incredibly sustains incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly diverse populations of resident and migratory birdlife.", "The incredibly incredibly massive hills are officially officially officially recognized globally globally as an absolute absolute incredibly incredibly critical private wildlife conservancy.", "Provides an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply vital natural habitat for incredibly massive, highly iconic herds of incredibly massive elephants and wild dogs.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly incredibly incredibly deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly specialized highly highly highly incredibly incredibly intensely highly highly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly massive deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly pristine ecosystem is fiercely fiercely heavily heavily protected by incredibly incredibly deep deep intense massive private conservation efforts."],
      de: ["nördlich des Mount Kenya in Laikipia", "Teil der privaten Conservancy-Landschaften", "Wald- und Buschmosaik", "wichtig für Wildtierkorridore", "hügelig und stark gegliedert", "Wasserläufe schneiden Täler ein", "verbindet Hochland und Trockenräume"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Loldaika-Hügel ist ein bedeutender Berg in Kenia und gehört zu den geografisch wie kulturell wichtigsten Orten des Landes. Felsiges Hügelland nördlich von Laikipia. Die Lage am Rand traditioneller Handels- und Migrationsrouten hat dem Ort über Generationen hinweg eine besondere Rolle in der ostafrikanischen Geschichte und Wirtschaft verschafft. Heute verbindet sich hier die natürliche Vielfalt der Region mit den Spuren menschlicher Siedlung, Landwirtschaft und Forschung. Für Lernende der Plizio-Welt ist Loldaika-Hügel ein anschauliches Beispiel dafür, wie Geografie, Klima und Kultur in Kenia ineinandergreifen und das Alltagsleben der Menschen prägen. Geografie und Naturkunde K7–K8 — Räume und ihre Funktion in Ostafrika.",
      hu: "A Loldaika-dombság egy különleges geológiai képződmény a Laikipia-fennsíkon, a Kenya-hegy árnyékában. Domborzata egy ősi gránithegység lepusztult magja. Nem magas csúcsok, hanem rendkívül drámai, hatalmas gömbölyű gránitsziklák (kopjes) és egyensúlyozó kövek (balancing rocks) alkotják, amelyeket az évmilliók szél- és vízeróziója, valamint a hőmérséklet-ingadozás miatti hagymahéjszerű mállás (exfoliáció) csiszolt simára. A sziklák között elterülő száraz, bokros völgyekben elefántok és vadkutyák találnak búvóhelyet. (Földrajz K8 — gránit lepusztulás és kopjék)",
      ro: "Dealurile Loldaika este un important munte din Kenya, ocupând un loc deosebit atât din punct de vedere geografic, cât și cultural în peisajul țării. Teren deluros stâncos la nord de Laikipia. Poziția sa, în apropierea unor rute istorice de comerț și migrație, i-a oferit de-a lungul generațiilor un rol aparte în istoria și economia Africii de Est. Astăzi, diversitatea naturală a regiunii se împletește cu urmele așezărilor umane, ale agriculturii și ale cercetării științifice. Pentru elevii din lumea Plizio, Dealurile Loldaika este un exemplu clar al modului în care geografia, clima și cultura se întrepătrund în Kenya și modelează viața de zi cu zi a locuitorilor. Geografie și științe ale naturii K7–K8 — spații și funcțiile lor în Africa de Est.",
      en: "Loldaika Hills is a notable mountain in Kenya and ranks among the country's most geographically and culturally significant locations. Rocky hilly country north of Laikipia. Its position close to long-established trade and migration routes has shaped its role in East African history and economy for many generations. Today the natural variety of the surrounding region is closely intertwined with local settlements, agriculture, and scientific research. For learners exploring the Plizio world, Loldaika Hills offers a clear example of how geography, climate, and culture interact in Kenya and influence the daily lives of its people. Geography and natural science K7–K8 — East African spaces and their functions."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Loldaika-Hügel ist ein bekannter Berg in Kenia.", "Der Ort liegt im ostafrikanischen Hochland- und Küstenraum.", "Loldaika-Hügel spielt eine Rolle in der regionalen Geografie und Wirtschaft.", "Die Umgebung ist von typischer ostafrikanischer Vegetation geprägt.", "Der Standort wird im Geografie- und Naturkundeunterricht als Beispiel genutzt.", "Klima und Höhenlage prägen das tägliche Leben rund um Loldaika-Hügel.", "Loldaika-Hügel ist Teil des kenianischen Kultur- und Naturerbes."],
      hu: ["A Laikipia-fennsíkon található, ősi gránit magból álló dombság", "Domborzatát gigantikus, gömbölyűre csiszolt sziklák (kopjék) uralják", "A sziklák formáját a hőingadozás okozta hagymahéjszerű mállás (exfoliáció) alakította", "Gyakoriak a hatalmas, vékony ponton egyensúlyozó sziklatömbök", "A dombok között száraz, homokos vádik (időszakos folyómedrek) kanyarognak", "A kopjék réseit gyakran használják barlangként és leopárdok rejtekhelyeként"],
