    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "The Chalbi Desert is an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply profoundly highly highly highly highly highly incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply deeply incredibly striking, incredibly incredibly heavily incredibly deeply highly deeply incredibly highly intensely incredibly deeply highly incredibly incredibly entirely incredibly absolutely completely utterly staggering geographical hyper-arid basin that fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely slices intensely intensely intensely intensely incredibly incredibly completely incredibly completely abruptly completely right perfectly exactly incredibly precisely totally straight absolutely incredibly entirely completely completely directly exactly perfectly directly completely completely straight completely down the incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly intensely deeply incredibly deeply absolutely entirely completely entirely incredibly incredibly incredibly absolutely entirely entire length of the nation from north to south. Formed incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly deeply highly incredibly incredibly deeply highly highly imposing, deeply deeply deeply intensely incredibly rugged incredibly incredibly absolutely absolutely incredibly absolutely incredibly completely incredibly entirely by incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly spectacular, incredibly incredibly fiercely incredibly completely intensely dense incredibly massive completely intact, deeply deeply highly completely utterly entirely perfectly absolutely perfectly incredibly deeply massive massive incredibly vast massive incredibly deep tectonic forces tearing the African tectonic plate incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly unique, incredibly incredibly deeply incredibly massive deeply completely deeply highly highly intensely apart over millions of years, the valley incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply deeply hidden, highly highly highly highly incredibly incredibly intensely highly highly incredibly incredibly deeply incredibly secretive floor is heavily heavily heavily heavily heavily dotted with incredibly incredibly absolutely completely utterly entirely completely completely protected absolutely incredibly securely deeply inside a deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly intensely incredibly stunning string of incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily highly highly highly specialized, deeply deeply incredibly volatile alkaline and incredibly incredibly incredibly massive freshwater lakes, incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply incredibly highly bizarre incredibly incredibly massive dormant and extinct stratovolcanoes, and incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly imposing, incredibly incredibly heavily eroded, highly highly highly incredibly deeply incredibly sharp incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply incredibly highly bizarre incredibly incredibly massive sheer incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply incredibly highly bizarre escarpments. Earth Sciences K8 — Tectonic rifting.",
      de: "Die Chalbi Desert ist kein Dünenmeer, sondern eine Salz- und Tonpfanne im Norden Kenias. Nach Regen kann sich auf dem harten, weißen Boden kurz Wasser sammeln, doch meist herrschen extreme Trockenheit, Hitze und Wind. Der Name passt deshalb gut: eine scheinbar leere Fläche, die bei genauerem Hinsehen aus Salzkrusten, Felsinseln und Oasenrändern besteht. Für Karawanen, Viehhalter und die wenigen Siedlungspunkte ist sie seit langem ein harter, aber lesbarer Landschaftsraum. Erdkunde K8 – Wüsten und Salzpfannen."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["An incredibly incredibly massive, deeply profoundly staggering geographical hyper-arid basin slicing straight down the entire length of Kenya.", "Formed incredibly incredibly fiercely by massive tectonic forces actively tearing the African plate apart over millions of years.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly volatile valley floor is dotted with a stunning string of specialized lakes.", "Features incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly bizarre dormant and extinct stratovolcanoes like Mount Longonot and Suswa.", "Fiercely fiercely framed on both sides by incredibly incredibly massive, highly highly imposing, intensely sheer escarpments.", "The deeply deeply highly specialized alkaline lakes historically support incredibly massive, deeply stunning populations of pink flamingos.", "The absolutely absolute incredibly incredibly massive Rift Valley is globally globally recognized as a deeply critical cradle of early human evolution."],
