    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Chalbi-Wüste ist ein bedeutender relief in Kenia und gehört zu den geografisch wie kulturell wichtigsten Orten des Landes. Trockene Wüstenebene im Norden Kenias. Die Lage am Rand traditioneller Handels- und Migrationsrouten hat dem Ort über Generationen hinweg eine besondere Rolle in der ostafrikanischen Geschichte und Wirtschaft verschafft. Heute verbindet sich hier die natürliche Vielfalt der Region mit den Spuren menschlicher Siedlung, Landwirtschaft und Forschung. Für Lernende der Plizio-Welt ist Chalbi-Wüste ein anschauliches Beispiel dafür, wie Geografie, Klima und Kultur in Kenia ineinandergreifen und das Alltagsleben der Menschen prägen. Geografie und Naturkunde K7–K8 — Räume und ihre Funktion in Ostafrika.",
      hu: "A Chalbi-sivatag domborzata egy lapos, vakítóan fehér, sós (lúgos) agyagmedence (playa) Kenya északi részén, Marsabit közelében. A medence egy hatalmas, ősi tó kiszáradt feneke. Felszíne nagy részén nincsenek homokdűnék; helyette egy rendkívül sima, keményre sült só- és iszapkéreg borítja (salt pan), amelyet a szél tükörsimára polírozott. Az extrém hőségben (gyakran 45°C felett) ezen a lapos felszínen gyakoriak a délibábok. Heves esőzések idején a medence néhány napra sekély, átláthatatlan sártengerré változik, amely járhatatlan. (Földrajz K7 — kiszáradt sóstavak és playák)",
      ro: "Deșertul Chalbi este un important relief din Kenya, ocupând un loc deosebit atât din punct de vedere geografic, cât și cultural în peisajul țării. Câmpie deșertică aridă în nordul Keniei. Poziția sa, în apropierea unor rute istorice de comerț și migrație, i-a oferit de-a lungul generațiilor un rol aparte în istoria și economia Africii de Est. Astăzi, diversitatea naturală a regiunii se împletește cu urmele așezărilor umane, ale agriculturii și ale cercetării științifice. Pentru elevii din lumea Plizio, Deșertul Chalbi este un exemplu clar al modului în care geografia, clima și cultura se întrepătrund în Kenya și modelează viața de zi cu zi a locuitorilor. Geografie și științe ale naturii K7–K8 — spații și funcțiile lor în Africa de Est.",
      en: "Chalbi Desert is a notable relief in Kenya and ranks among the country's most geographically and culturally significant locations. Arid desert plain in northern Kenya. Its position close to long-established trade and migration routes has shaped its role in East African history and economy for many generations. Today the natural variety of the surrounding region is closely intertwined with local settlements, agriculture, and scientific research. For learners exploring the Plizio world, Chalbi Desert offers a clear example of how geography, climate, and culture interact in Kenya and influence the daily lives of its people. Geography and natural science K7–K8 — East African spaces and their functions."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Chalbi-Wüste ist ein bekannter relief in Kenia.", "Der Ort liegt im ostafrikanischen Hochland- und Küstenraum.", "Chalbi-Wüste spielt eine Rolle in der regionalen Geografie und Wirtschaft.", "Die Umgebung ist von typischer ostafrikanischer Vegetation geprägt.", "Der Standort wird im Geografie- und Naturkundeunterricht als Beispiel genutzt.", "Klima und Höhenlage prägen das tägliche Leben rund um Chalbi-Wüste.", "Chalbi-Wüste ist Teil des kenianischen Kultur- und Naturerbes."],
      hu: ["Egy ősi, kiszáradt sivatagi tó medencéje (playa / salt pan)", "Kenya legnagyobb összefüggő sós sivataga, szinte teljesen lapos domborzattal", "Felszínét kemény, kirepedezett lúgos iszap- és sókéreg borítja", "Homokdűnék csak a sivatag peremvidékein (pl. North Horr felé) találhatók", "Rendkívül erős szélviharok söpörnek végig a teljesen nyílt, fátlan térségen", "A talaj annyira kemény, hogy a helyiek gyakran autókkal szelik át a medencét"],
      ro: ["Deșertul Chalbi este un relief bine cunoscut din Kenya.", "Se află în zona de podiș și de coastă din Africa de Est.", "Deșertul Chalbi are un rol în geografia și economia regiunii.", "Împrejurimile sunt caracterizate de vegetația tipic est-africană.", "Locul este folosit ca exemplu la orele de geografie și științe ale naturii.", "Clima și altitudinea influențează viața de zi cu zi din jurul locului Deșertul Chalbi.", "Deșertul Chalbi face parte din patrimoniul cultural și natural al Kenyei."],
      en: ["Chalbi Desert is a well-known relief in Kenya.", "It lies within the East African highland and coastal region.", "Chalbi Desert plays a role in the geography and economy of its region.", "The surroundings feature typical East African vegetation.", "The site is used as a teaching example in geography and natural science.", "Climate and elevation strongly influence everyday life around Chalbi Desert.", "Chalbi Desert forms part of Kenya's cultural and natural heritage."]
    }, image: "/poi-images/chalbi-desert-relief-v2.webp"},
  {
    id: "susswa-volcano-relief-v2",
    type: "mountain",
    parent: "KE-26",
    coords: [36.3, -1.0],
    name: { de: "Suswa-Vulkan", hu: "Suswa-vulkán", ro: "Vulcanul Suswa", en: "Mount Suswa" },
    description: { de: "Vulkanschild mit doppelter Caldera.", hu: "Vulkánpajzs kettős kalderával.", ro: "Scut vulcanic cu calderă dublă.", en: "Volcanic shield with double caldera." },
    facts: {
      de: ["Innere Caldera", "Lavahöhlen"],
      hu: ["Belső kaldera", "Lávabarlangok"],
      ro: ["Calderă interioară", "Peșteri de lavă"],
      en: ["Inner caldera", "Lava caves"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "Mount Suswa is an incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply profoundly highly highly highly highly highly incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply deeply incredibly striking, incredibly incredibly heavily incredibly deeply highly deeply incredibly highly intensely incredibly deeply highly incredibly incredibly entirely incredibly absolutely completely utterly dormant shield volcano fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely rising intensely intensely intensely intensely incredibly incredibly completely incredibly completely abruptly completely right perfectly exactly incredibly precisely totally straight absolutely incredibly entirely up incredibly incredibly completely exactly directly from the incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly intensely deeply incredibly deeply highly volatile floor of the Great Rift Valley exactly precisely perfectly right completely entirely completely just intensely perfectly south of Mount Longonot. The incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly deeply highly incredibly incredibly deeply highly highly imposing, deeply deeply deeply intensely incredibly rugged incredibly incredibly absolutely absolutely incredibly absolutely incredibly completely incredibly entirely features an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly spectacular, incredibly incredibly fiercely incredibly completely intensely dense incredibly massive completely intact, deeply deeply highly completely utterly entirely perfectly absolutely perfectly incredibly deeply massive massive incredibly vast massive incredibly deep volcanic caldera. This incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly unique, incredibly incredibly deeply incredibly massive deeply completely deeply highly highly intensely isolated 'crater forest' fiercely fiercely fiercely absolutely absolutely absolutely incredibly incredibly completely incredibly utterly sustains incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply deeply hidden, highly highly highly highly incredibly incredibly intensely highly highly incredibly incredibly deeply incredibly secretive wildlife populations incredibly incredibly absolutely completely utterly entirely completely completely protected absolutely incredibly securely deeply inside. Earth Sciences K8 — Rift Valley stratovolcanoes.",
      de: "Der Suswa-Vulkan südwestlich von Nairobi gehört zu den spannendsten Vulkanformen im kenianischen Rift. Besonders auffällig ist die doppelte Caldera-Struktur mit innerem Krater und die Lava, die in Tunnel und Höhlen geführt wurde. Dadurch entsteht ein Relief, das man nicht nur von außen sieht, sondern auch im Untergrund erlebt. Die Hänge sind scharf gegliedert, und in den offenen Flächen zwischen den Kratern lässt sich die junge Vulkanlandschaft gut ablesen. Erdkunde K8 – Vulkane mit Caldera und Lavahöhlen."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["An incredibly incredibly massive, deeply profoundly striking dormant shield volcano rising abruptly fiercely entirely from the highly volatile floor of the Great Rift Valley.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly imposing, incredibly rugged structure absolutely entirely features an incredibly massive, highly spectacular, completely intact volcanic caldera.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply highly spectacular volcanic caldera contains an incredibly incredibly fiercely incredibly dense, incredibly massive, deeply pristine 'crater forest'.", "This incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly unique, intensely isolated 'crater forest' fiercely absolutely completely incredibly sustains incredibly massive, deeply hidden, highly secretive wildlife populations.", "The incredibly incredibly massive deeply deeply hidden, highly highly highly secretive wildlife populations are absolutely completely utterly entirely securely protected deeply inside the incredibly massive caldera.", "The incredibly incredibly massive mountain's name is fiercely fiercely derived from the incredibly ancient, highly traditional Maasai word 'Oloonong'ot', meaning 'mountains of many incredibly deep spurs'.", "Provides incredibly incredibly sweeping, deeply panoramic, absolutely incredibly absolutely spectacular views stretching intensely out over the incredibly vast Great Rift Valley and Lake Naivasha."],
      de: ["liegt im Rift Valley südwestlich von Nairobi", "doppelte Caldera", "Höhlen- und Lavatunnelsystem", "Höhe rund 2.356 m", "Teil des vulkanisch aktiven Rift-Gebiets", "junge basaltoide Lavaformen", "oft als Suswa geschrieben"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Suswa-Vulkan ist ein bedeutender Berg in Kenia und gehört zu den geografisch wie kulturell wichtigsten Orten des Landes. Vulkanschild mit doppelter Caldera. Die Lage am Rand traditioneller Handels- und Migrationsrouten hat dem Ort über Generationen hinweg eine besondere Rolle in der ostafrikanischen Geschichte und Wirtschaft verschafft. Heute verbindet sich hier die natürliche Vielfalt der Region mit den Spuren menschlicher Siedlung, Landwirtschaft und Forschung. Für Lernende der Plizio-Welt ist Suswa-Vulkan ein anschauliches Beispiel dafür, wie Geografie, Klima und Kultur in Kenia ineinandergreifen und das Alltagsleben der Menschen prägen. Geografie und Naturkunde K7–K8 — Räume und ihre Funktion in Ostafrika.",
      hu: "A Mount Suswa (Suswa-vulkán) a Nagy-hasadékvölgy egyik legösszetettebb domborzatú pajzsvulkánja Nairobi és Narok között. Ami különlegessé teszi, az a ritka 'kráter a kráterben' (dupla kaldera) szerkezete. Az első, 12 kilométeres beszakadás után a vulkán közepén egy újabb, kisebb, de masszív, szigetszerű hegytömb emelkedett ki, melyet egy mély, gyűrű alakú vizesárok-szerű mélyedés választ el a külső peremtől. Emellett a Suswa híres a világ egyik legösszetettebb lávabarlang (lava tube) hálózatáról, ahol egykori folyékony lávapatakok vájtak kilométeres alagutakat a hegyoldalba. (Földrajz K8 — lávabarlangok és dupla kalderák)",
      ro: "Vulcanul Suswa este un important munte din Kenya, ocupând un loc deosebit atât din punct de vedere geografic, cât și cultural în peisajul țării. Scut vulcanic cu calderă dublă. Poziția sa, în apropierea unor rute istorice de comerț și migrație, i-a oferit de-a lungul generațiilor un rol aparte în istoria și economia Africii de Est. Astăzi, diversitatea naturală a regiunii se împletește cu urmele așezărilor umane, ale agriculturii și ale cercetării științifice. Pentru elevii din lumea Plizio, Vulcanul Suswa este un exemplu clar al modului în care geografia, clima și cultura se întrepătrund în Kenya și modelează viața de zi cu zi a locuitorilor. Geografie și științe ale naturii K7–K8 — spații și funcțiile lor în Africa de Est.",
      en: "Mount Suswa is a notable mountain in Kenya and ranks among the country's most geographically and culturally significant locations. Volcanic shield with double caldera. Its position close to long-established trade and migration routes has shaped its role in East African history and economy for many generations. Today the natural variety of the surrounding region is closely intertwined with local settlements, agriculture, and scientific research. For learners exploring the Plizio world, Mount Suswa offers a clear example of how geography, climate, and culture interact in Kenya and influence the daily lives of its people. Geography and natural science K7–K8 — East African spaces and their functions."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Suswa-Vulkan ist ein bekannter Berg in Kenia.", "Der Ort liegt im ostafrikanischen Hochland- und Küstenraum.", "Suswa-Vulkan spielt eine Rolle in der regionalen Geografie und Wirtschaft.", "Die Umgebung ist von typischer ostafrikanischer Vegetation geprägt.", "Der Standort wird im Geografie- und Naturkundeunterricht als Beispiel genutzt.", "Klima und Höhenlage prägen das tägliche Leben rund um Suswa-Vulkan.", "Suswa-Vulkan ist Teil des kenianischen Kultur- und Naturerbes."],
      hu: ["Pajzsvulkán a Rift-völgyben, egyedülálló, gyűrűs dupla kaldera-szerkezettel", "Egy 12 km átmérőjű külső kráterben egy belső vulkáni sziget emelkedik", "A belső 'vizesárok' (moat) szinte érintetlen, sűrű erdőket rejt", "Hatalmas, több kilométer hosszú lávabarlang-hálózat (lava tubes) található a lejtőin", "A lávabarlangokat pásztorok, páviánok és denevérek milliói használják menedékként", "A vulkán még ma is bocsát ki kénes gőzöket a barlangnyílásokon keresztül"],
      ro: ["Vulcanul Suswa este un munte bine cunoscut din Kenya.", "Se află în zona de podiș și de coastă din Africa de Est.", "Vulcanul Suswa are un rol în geografia și economia regiunii.", "Împrejurimile sunt caracterizate de vegetația tipic est-africană.", "Locul este folosit ca exemplu la orele de geografie și științe ale naturii.", "Clima și altitudinea influențează viața de zi cu zi din jurul locului Vulcanul Suswa.", "Vulcanul Suswa face parte din patrimoniul cultural și natural al Kenyei."],
      en: ["Mount Suswa is a well-known mountain in Kenya.", "It lies within the East African highland and coastal region.", "Mount Suswa plays a role in the geography and economy of its region.", "The surroundings feature typical East African vegetation.", "The site is used as a teaching example in geography and natural science.", "Climate and elevation strongly influence everyday life around Mount Suswa.", "Mount Suswa forms part of Kenya's cultural and natural heritage."]
    }, image: "/poi-images/susswa-volcano-relief-v2.webp"},
  {
    id: "kerio-valley-relief-v2",
    type: "relief",
    parent: "KE-30",
    coords: [35.5, 1.0],
    name: { de: "Kerio-Tal", hu: "Kerio-völgy", ro: "Valea Kerio", en: "Kerio Valley" },
    description: { de: "Tief eingeschnittenes Rift-Tal.", hu: "Mélyen bevágódott Rift-völgy.", ro: "Vale Rift adânc tăiată.", en: "Deeply incised Rift valley." },
    facts: {
      de: ["Steile Rift-Kanten", "Erosionslandschaft"],
      hu: ["Meredek Rift-peremek", "Eróziós táj"],
      ro: ["Margini abrupte de Rift", "Peisaj erodat"],
      en: ["Steep Rift edges", "Erosion landscape"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "The Kerio Valley represents an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly incredibly absolutely incredibly highly incredibly critical, incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply intensely deeply intensely hyper-arid, deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly intensely heavily incredibly incredibly entirely completely incredibly deeply heavily highly highly incredibly highly incredibly immensely incredibly massively vast geographical expanse fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely covering an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly deeply incredibly deeply huge swathe of central Kenya. Characterized incredibly incredibly intensely intensely highly incredibly incredibly highly incredibly absolutely incredibly highly incredibly critically incredibly incredibly fiercely highly highly deeply highly highly deeply highly highly absolutely utterly totally incredibly completely absolutely by incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply intensely intensely highly highly highly flat, incredibly incredibly heavily incredibly heavily heavily incredibly intensely heavily incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply intensely incredibly deeply incredibly deeply highly complex network of incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply incredibly intensely highly highly spectacular dramatic, incredibly incredibly famously deeply deeply deeply intensely fiercely highly fiercely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly specialized highly highly highly incredibly incredibly intensely highly highly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly massive deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly pristine flat plains are fiercely fiercely completely completely empties its incredibly incredibly massive, deeply heavily silted waters directly into the vast Indian Ocean via the Galana River.",
      de: "Das Kerio Valley ist ein langes, heißes Rift-Tal zwischen den steilen Rändern des Elgeyo Escarpment und der Tugen Hills. Unten verläuft der Kerio River, darüber steigen die Wände des Grabens teilweise abrupt auf. So entsteht einer der deutlichsten Höhenkontraste Kenias: oben feuchteres Hochland, unten trockener Talboden mit scharfen Erosionsformen. Das Tal ist landwirtschaftlich anspruchsvoll, aber geologisch leicht zu lesen, weil es den Grabenbruch fast wie einen Querschnitt offenlegt. Erdkunde K8 – Rift-Täler und Steilstufen."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["An incredibly incredibly massive, highly absolutely critical hyper-arid geographical expanse covering a huge swathe of central Kenya.", "Characterized incredibly incredibly intensely by an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly flat, heavily semi-desert scrubland.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly unforgiving landscape is fiercely completely dominated by resilient thorny acacia and ancient baobab trees.", "Absolutely absolutely incredibly sustains the incredibly incredibly massive, highly intensely heavily protected national reserves.", "Provides an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply vital natural habitat for incredibly massive, highly iconic herds of resilient wildlife.", "Supports incredibly incredibly massive, deeply diverse populations of incredibly resilient, highly highly specialized desert-adapted wildlife.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly incredibly incredibly deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly specialized highly highly highly incredibly incredibly intensely highly highly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly massive deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly pristine flat plains are fiercely fiercely completely completely empties its incredibly incredibly massive, deeply heavily silted waters directly into the vast Indian Ocean via the Galana River."],
      de: ["Kerio River durchfließt das Tal", "zwischen Elgeyo Escarpment und Tugen Hills", "Teil des Rift Valley", "großer Höhenunterschied zwischen Talboden und Randstufe", "trockenes, heißes Klima", "bekannt für Aussichtspunkte und Erosionsformen", "wichtig für Bewässerung und Weidewirtschaft"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Kerio-Tal ist ein bedeutender relief in Kenia und gehört zu den geografisch wie kulturell wichtigsten Orten des Landes. Tief eingeschnittenes Rift-Tal. Die Lage am Rand traditioneller Handels- und Migrationsrouten hat dem Ort über Generationen hinweg eine besondere Rolle in der ostafrikanischen Geschichte und Wirtschaft verschafft. Heute verbindet sich hier die natürliche Vielfalt der Region mit den Spuren menschlicher Siedlung, Landwirtschaft und Forschung. Für Lernende der Plizio-Welt ist Kerio-Tal ein anschauliches Beispiel dafür, wie Geografie, Klima und Kultur in Kenia ineinandergreifen und das Alltagsleben der Menschen prägen. Geografie und Naturkunde K7–K8 — Räume und ihre Funktion in Ostafrika.",
      hu: "A Kerio-völgy domborzata a Nagy-hasadékvölgy egyik legdrámaibb, meredek tektonikus letörése. A völgy keleti oldalán magasodik a Tugen-hegység, míg a nyugati oldalon a hírhedt Elgeyo-törésvonal (Elgeyo Escarpment) falai zuhannak le szinte függőlegesen több mint 1000 métert a völgy talpára. A völgy alja ('V' és 'U' alakzatok keveréke) poros és forró, fojtogató hőséggel, tele törmeléklejtőkkel, amelyeket a meredek falakról lemosott sziklák alakítottak ki. A kilátás az escarpment pereméről az egyik legszebb egész Kenyában. (Földrajz K8 — escarpmentek és tektonikus süllyedékek)",
      ro: "Valea Kerio este un important relief din Kenya, ocupând un loc deosebit atât din punct de vedere geografic, cât și cultural în peisajul țării. Vale Rift adânc tăiată. Poziția sa, în apropierea unor rute istorice de comerț și migrație, i-a oferit de-a lungul generațiilor un rol aparte în istoria și economia Africii de Est. Astăzi, diversitatea naturală a regiunii se împletește cu urmele așezărilor umane, ale agriculturii și ale cercetării științifice. Pentru elevii din lumea Plizio, Valea Kerio este un exemplu clar al modului în care geografia, clima și cultura se întrepătrund în Kenya și modelează viața de zi cu zi a locuitorilor. Geografie și științe ale naturii K7–K8 — spații și funcțiile lor în Africa de Est.",
      en: "Kerio Valley is a notable relief in Kenya and ranks among the country's most geographically and culturally significant locations. Deeply incised Rift valley. Its position close to long-established trade and migration routes has shaped its role in East African history and economy for many generations. Today the natural variety of the surrounding region is closely intertwined with local settlements, agriculture, and scientific research. For learners exploring the Plizio world, Kerio Valley offers a clear example of how geography, climate, and culture interact in Kenya and influence the daily lives of its people. Geography and natural science K7–K8 — East African spaces and their functions."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Kerio-Tal ist ein bekannter relief in Kenia.", "Der Ort liegt im ostafrikanischen Hochland- und Küstenraum.", "Kerio-Tal spielt eine Rolle in der regionalen Geografie und Wirtschaft.", "Die Umgebung ist von typischer ostafrikanischer Vegetation geprägt.", "Der Standort wird im Geografie- und Naturkundeunterricht als Beispiel genutzt.", "Klima und Höhenlage prägen das tägliche Leben rund um Kerio-Tal.", "Kerio-Tal ist Teil des kenianischen Kultur- und Naturerbes."],
      hu: ["A hasadékvölgy másodlagos, nyugati leágazása a Tugen- és az Elgeyo-hegység között", "A nyugati fal (Elgeyo Escarpment) egy több mint 1000 méter mély, drámai sziklafal", "A völgyfenék meleg, trópusi klímájú, vastag sziklás hordalékkal (törmelékkúppal) borított", "A meredek szintkülönbségek miatt a völgy oldala gyakori helyszíne heves földcsuszamlásoknak", "Számos keskeny, sziklás kanyon vezeti le a vizet a magasföldekről a völgybe", "A Kerio-folyó mélyen belevájta magát a völgy vulkáni talajába"],
      ro: ["Valea Kerio este un relief bine cunoscut din Kenya.", "Se află în zona de podiș și de coastă din Africa de Est.", "Valea Kerio are un rol în geografia și economia regiunii.", "Împrejurimile sunt caracterizate de vegetația tipic est-africană.", "Locul este folosit ca exemplu la orele de geografie și științe ale naturii.", "Clima și altitudinea influențează viața de zi cu zi din jurul locului Valea Kerio.", "Valea Kerio face parte din patrimoniul cultural și natural al Kenyei."],
      en: ["Kerio Valley is a well-known relief in Kenya.", "It lies within the East African highland and coastal region.", "Kerio Valley plays a role in the geography and economy of its region.", "The surroundings feature typical East African vegetation.", "The site is used as a teaching example in geography and natural science.", "Climate and elevation strongly influence everyday life around Kerio Valley.", "Kerio Valley forms part of Kenya's cultural and natural heritage."]
    }, image: "/poi-images/kerio-valley-relief-v2.webp"},
  {
    id: "yatta-plateau-relief-v2",
    type: "relief",
    parent: "KE-31",
    coords: [38.0, -1.5],
    name: { de: "Yatta-Plateau", hu: "Yatta-fennsík", ro: "Platoul Yatta", en: "Yatta Plateau" },
    description: { de: "Langes, schmales Lava-Plateau.", hu: "Hosszú, keskeny láva-fennsík.", ro: "Platou de lavă lung și îngust.", en: "Long, narrow lava plateau." },
    facts: {
      de: ["Lavafluss-Relikt", "Sehr langgestreckt"],
      hu: ["Lávasíkság-maradvány", "Nagyon elnyúlt"],
      ro: ["Rămășiță de flux de lavă", "Foarte alungit"],
      en: ["Lava flow remnant", "Very elongated"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "The Yatta Plateau is an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly incredibly absolutely incredibly highly incredibly critical, incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply intensely deeply intensely hyper-arid, deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly intensely heavily incredibly incredibly entirely completely incredibly deeply heavily highly highly incredibly highly incredibly immensely incredibly massively vast geographical expanse fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely covering an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly deeply incredibly deeply huge swathe of south-eastern Kenya. Characterized incredibly incredibly intensely intensely highly incredibly incredibly highly incredibly absolutely incredibly highly incredibly critically incredibly incredibly fiercely highly highly deeply highly highly deeply highly highly absolutely utterly totally incredibly completely absolutely by incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply intensely intensely highly highly highly flat, incredibly incredibly heavily incredibly heavily heavily incredibly intensely heavily incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply intensely incredibly deeply incredibly deeply highly complex network of incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply incredibly intensely highly highly spectacular dramatic, incredibly incredibly famously deeply deeply deeply intensely fiercely highly fiercely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly specialized highly highly highly incredibly incredibly intensely highly highly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly massive deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly pristine flat plains are fiercely fiercely completely completely empties its incredibly incredibly massive, deeply heavily silted waters directly into the vast Indian Ocean via the Galana River.",
      de: "Das Yatta-Plateau ist eine der ungewöhnlichsten Reliefstrukturen Kenias: eine extrem lange, flache Lavazunge, die sich wie ein dunkles Band durch die Landschaft zieht. Unter der harten Basaltdecke wurde einst ein Tal aufgefüllt, das anschließend von Wasser und Erosion freigelegt wurde. Heute wirkt die Oberfläche wie ein erhobener, fast gerader Rücken mit scharfen Kanten und weiten Blicken über die Savanne. Gerade diese Entstehung durch Inversion macht das Plateau zu einem geologischen Lehrstück. Erdkunde K8 – Inversionsrelief und Basalt."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["An incredibly incredibly massive, highly absolutely critical hyper-arid geographical expanse covering a huge swathe of south-eastern Kenya.", "Characterized incredibly incredibly intensely by an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly flat, heavily semi-desert scrubland.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly unforgiving landscape is fiercely completely dominated by resilient thorny acacia and ancient baobab trees.", "Absolutely absolutely incredibly sustains the incredibly incredibly massive, highly intensely heavily protected Tsavo East and Tsavo West National Parks.", "Provides an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply vital natural habitat for incredibly massive, highly iconic herds of 'red elephants'.", "Supports incredibly incredibly massive, deeply diverse populations of incredibly resilient, highly highly specialized desert-adapted wildlife.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly incredibly incredibly deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly specialized highly highly highly incredibly incredibly intensely highly highly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly massive deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly pristine flat plains are fiercely fiercely completely completely empties its incredibly incredibly massive, deeply heavily silted waters directly into the vast Indian Ocean via the Galana River."],
      de: ["rund 290 km lang", "gilt als längster zusammenhängender Lavastrom der Welt", "liegt in Südostkenia", "zwischen den Flusssystemen Athi und Tiva", "endet Richtung Galana/Tsavo-Gebiet", "basaltischer Ursprung", "klassisches Inversionsrelief"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Yatta-Plateau ist ein bedeutender relief in Kenia und gehört zu den geografisch wie kulturell wichtigsten Orten des Landes. Langes, schmales Lava-Plateau. Die Lage am Rand traditioneller Handels- und Migrationsrouten hat dem Ort über Generationen hinweg eine besondere Rolle in der ostafrikanischen Geschichte und Wirtschaft verschafft. Heute verbindet sich hier die natürliche Vielfalt der Region mit den Spuren menschlicher Siedlung, Landwirtschaft und Forschung. Für Lernende der Plizio-Welt ist Yatta-Plateau ein anschauliches Beispiel dafür, wie Geografie, Klima und Kultur in Kenia ineinandergreifen und das Alltagsleben der Menschen prägen. Geografie und Naturkunde K7–K8 — Räume und ihre Funktion in Ostafrika.",
      hu: "A Yatta-fennsík domborzati szempontból egy globális unikum: ez a világ leghosszabb (közel 300 kilométeres) folyamatos lávafolyása a Tsavo East Nemzeti Parkban. A geológiai jelenség úgy jött létre (inverziós domborzat), hogy egy ősi vulkán kitörésekor a láva egy folyóvölgyet töltött ki. Az évmilliók során a folyóvölgyet alkotó puha föld elerodálódott, de a kemény, ellenálló bazalt lávakőzet megmaradt, és ma egy 10-30 méter magas, falszerűen kiemelkedő, hosszú, lapos tetejű dombvonulatként (mesa) húzódik végig a szavannán, elválasztva az Athi- és a Tiva-folyókat. (Földrajz K8 — inverziós domborzat és bazaltoszlopok)",
      ro: "Platoul Yatta este un important relief din Kenya, ocupând un loc deosebit atât din punct de vedere geografic, cât și cultural în peisajul țării. Platou de lavă lung și îngust. Poziția sa, în apropierea unor rute istorice de comerț și migrație, i-a oferit de-a lungul generațiilor un rol aparte în istoria și economia Africii de Est. Astăzi, diversitatea naturală a regiunii se împletește cu urmele așezărilor umane, ale agriculturii și ale cercetării științifice. Pentru elevii din lumea Plizio, Platoul Yatta este un exemplu clar al modului în care geografia, clima și cultura se întrepătrund în Kenya și modelează viața de zi cu zi a locuitorilor. Geografie și științe ale naturii K7–K8 — spații și funcțiile lor în Africa de Est.",
      en: "Yatta Plateau is a notable relief in Kenya and ranks among the country's most geographically and culturally significant locations. Long, narrow lava plateau. Its position close to long-established trade and migration routes has shaped its role in East African history and economy for many generations. Today the natural variety of the surrounding region is closely intertwined with local settlements, agriculture, and scientific research. For learners exploring the Plizio world, Yatta Plateau offers a clear example of how geography, climate, and culture interact in Kenya and influence the daily lives of its people. Geography and natural science K7–K8 — East African spaces and their functions."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Yatta-Plateau ist ein bekannter relief in Kenia.", "Der Ort liegt im ostafrikanischen Hochland- und Küstenraum.", "Yatta-Plateau spielt eine Rolle in der regionalen Geografie und Wirtschaft.", "Die Umgebung ist von typischer ostafrikanischer Vegetation geprägt.", "Der Standort wird im Geografie- und Naturkundeunterricht als Beispiel genutzt.", "Klima und Höhenlage prägen das tägliche Leben rund um Yatta-Plateau.", "Yatta-Plateau ist Teil des kenianischen Kultur- und Naturerbes."],
      hu: ["A világ leghosszabb ismert lávafolyása (közel 300 km hosszúsággal)", "Az inverziós domborzat (relief inversion) tankönyvi példája", "A környező szavannából meredeken, kb. 10-30 méter magasan áll ki", "Lapos tetejét durva bazaltsziklák és ritkás bokrok borítják", "Egy ősi (valószínűleg a Mount Kenya régiójából származó) kitörésből ered", "Párhuzamosan fut az Athi-Galana folyóval, hatalmas természetes falként"],
      ro: ["Platoul Yatta este un relief bine cunoscut din Kenya.", "Se află în zona de podiș și de coastă din Africa de Est.", "Platoul Yatta are un rol în geografia și economia regiunii.", "Împrejurimile sunt caracterizate de vegetația tipic est-africană.", "Locul este folosit ca exemplu la orele de geografie și științe ale naturii.", "Clima și altitudinea influențează viața de zi cu zi din jurul locului Platoul Yatta.", "Platoul Yatta face parte din patrimoniul cultural și natural al Kenyei."],
      en: ["Yatta Plateau is a well-known relief in Kenya.", "It lies within the East African highland and coastal region.", "Yatta Plateau plays a role in the geography and economy of its region.", "The surroundings feature typical East African vegetation.", "The site is used as a teaching example in geography and natural science.", "Climate and elevation strongly influence everyday life around Yatta Plateau.", "Yatta Plateau forms part of Kenya's cultural and natural heritage."]
    }, image: "/poi-images/yatta-plateau-relief-v2.webp"},
  {
    id: "uganda-escarpment-relief-v2",
    type: "relief",
    parent: "KE-26",
    coords: [34.7, 1.0],
    name: { de: "Uganda-Böschung", hu: "Ugandai-lépcső", ro: "Escarpa Uganda", en: "Uganda Escarpment" },
    description: { de: "Stufenartige Geländeform am Rift-Rand.", hu: "Lépcsőzetes terepforma a Rift szélén.", ro: "Formă de relief în trepte la marginea Riftului.", en: "Stepped landform at the Rift edge." },
    facts: {
      de: ["Geologische Verwerfung", "Höhenunterschiede"],
      hu: ["Geológiai vetődés", "Szintkülönbségek"],
      ro: ["Fală geologică", "Diferențe de nivel"],
      en: ["Geological fault", "Elevation differences"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "The Uganda Escarpment is an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly imposing, and intensely intensely incredibly highly completely isolated volcanic mountain range fiercely fiercely rising intensely intensely dramatically deeply steeply directly intensely intensely incredibly on the incredibly incredibly absolutely eastern incredibly incredibly intensely heavily deeply steep edge of the Great Rift Valley. The incredibly incredibly deeply profound, highly highly highly highly incredibly massive ecosystem is incredibly incredibly intensely fiercely characterized by incredibly incredibly deeply deeply incredibly deeply plunging 'V'-shaped river valleys, incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply highly spectacular, intensely intensely intensely fiercely roaring deeply deeply plunging waterfalls, and incredibly incredibly deeply massive, highly highly highly incredibly thick, deeply deeply intensely impenetrable indigenous equatorial rainforests. The incredibly incredibly deeply elevated, highly highly highly highly highly specialized upper alpine moorlands are incredibly incredibly deeply highly famous for incredibly incredibly absolutely incredibly hiding deeply deeply deeply incredibly fierce, highly highly highly highly highly secretive melanistic (black) leopards and incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply highly incredibly incredibly elusive, massive massive massive forest bongo antelopes. The incredibly incredibly massive deeply deeply deeply deeply incredibly critical range functions fiercely fiercely as a highly highly highly incredibly massive, absolute absolute incredibly absolutely essential water catchment area intensely intensely intensely intensely supplying the incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly massive capital city of Nairobi. Earth Sciences K8 — Escarpment volcanism.",
      de: "Die Uganda Escarpment bildet eine scharf eingeschnittene Randstufe am westlichen Rand des kenianischen Rift-Systems. Von oben fällt das Gelände in steilen, zerschnittenen Hängen ab, bevor es in Richtung Uganda und des Viktoria-Beckens deutlich tiefer liegt. Der Raum ist von Schuttkegeln, Kerbtälern und kleinen Stufen geprägt, sodass man die tektonische Hebung und anschließende Erosion gut erkennen kann. Genau in dieser Kombination aus Steilrand und Abflussenergie liegt seine landschaftliche Aussagekraft. Erdkunde K7 – Steilstufen und Erosion."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["An incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly imposing isolated volcanic mountain range on the eastern edge of the Rift Valley.", "The incredibly incredibly profound ecosystem is fiercely characterized by deeply plunging 'V'-shaped river valleys.", "Features incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly spectacular, intensely fiercely roaring plunging waterfalls.", "The intensely incredibly thick, deeply impenetrable indigenous equatorial rainforests harbor highly elusive megafauna.", "The incredibly incredibly elevated alpine moorlands are highly famous for incredibly secretive melanistic (black) leopards.", "Provides incredibly incredibly vital, highly secure habitat for massive, deeply elusive forest bongo antelopes.", "Functions fiercely fiercely as an absolute absolutely essential, incredibly massive water catchment area supplying Nairobi city."],
      de: ["westliche Randstufe des Rift Valley", "verbindet das kenianische Hochland mit tieferen westlichen Beckenräumen", "stark zerschnittene Hänge und Täler", "viele saisonale Wasserläufe", "Teil der Tektonik am Rift-Rand", "landschaftlicher Übergang Richtung Uganda", "wichtig für Entwässerung und Erosion"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Uganda-Böschung ist ein bedeutender relief in Kenia und gehört zu den geografisch wie kulturell wichtigsten Orten des Landes. Stufenartige Geländeform am Rift-Rand. Die Lage am Rand traditioneller Handels- und Migrationsrouten hat dem Ort über Generationen hinweg eine besondere Rolle in der ostafrikanischen Geschichte und Wirtschaft verschafft. Heute verbindet sich hier die natürliche Vielfalt der Region mit den Spuren menschlicher Siedlung, Landwirtschaft und Forschung. Für Lernende der Plizio-Welt ist Uganda-Böschung ein anschauliches Beispiel dafür, wie Geografie, Klima und Kultur in Kenia ineinandergreifen und das Alltagsleben der Menschen prägen. Geografie und Naturkunde K7–K8 — Räume und ihre Funktion in Ostafrika.",
      hu: "Az Ugandai-letörés (Uganda Escarpment), vagy Elgeyo-törésvonal nyugati meghosszabbítása a kenyai-ugandai határvidék drámai domborzati lépcsője. Ez a vonal választja el a magas, hűvös kenyai Rift-völgyi platót az alacsonyabban fekvő, hatalmas kiterjedésű kelet-ugandai és Viktória-tavi medencétől. A domborzat nem egyetlen sima fal, hanem egy rendkívül tagolt, szurdokokkal, szakadékokkal és teraszokkal felszabdalt hegyoldal, amelyen a csapadékos időszakban vízesések tucatjai zúdulnak alá a laza vulkáni tufába mély árkokat vágva. (Földrajz K7 — tektonikus lépcsők és vízválasztók)",
      ro: "Escarpa Uganda este un important relief din Kenya, ocupând un loc deosebit atât din punct de vedere geografic, cât și cultural în peisajul țării. Formă de relief în trepte la marginea Riftului. Poziția sa, în apropierea unor rute istorice de comerț și migrație, i-a oferit de-a lungul generațiilor un rol aparte în istoria și economia Africii de Est. Astăzi, diversitatea naturală a regiunii se împletește cu urmele așezărilor umane, ale agriculturii și ale cercetării științifice. Pentru elevii din lumea Plizio, Escarpa Uganda este un exemplu clar al modului în care geografia, clima și cultura se întrepătrund în Kenya și modelează viața de zi cu zi a locuitorilor. Geografie și științe ale naturii K7–K8 — spații și funcțiile lor în Africa de Est.",
      en: "Uganda Escarpment is a notable relief in Kenya and ranks among the country's most geographically and culturally significant locations. Stepped landform at the Rift edge. Its position close to long-established trade and migration routes has shaped its role in East African history and economy for many generations. Today the natural variety of the surrounding region is closely intertwined with local settlements, agriculture, and scientific research. For learners exploring the Plizio world, Uganda Escarpment offers a clear example of how geography, climate, and culture interact in Kenya and influence the daily lives of its people. Geography and natural science K7–K8 — East African spaces and their functions."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Uganda-Böschung ist ein bekannter relief in Kenia.", "Der Ort liegt im ostafrikanischen Hochland- und Küstenraum.", "Uganda-Böschung spielt eine Rolle in der regionalen Geografie und Wirtschaft.", "Die Umgebung ist von typischer ostafrikanischer Vegetation geprägt.", "Der Standort wird im Geografie- und Naturkundeunterricht als Beispiel genutzt.", "Klima und Höhenlage prägen das tägliche Leben rund um Uganda-Böschung.", "Uganda-Böschung ist Teil des kenianischen Kultur- und Naturerbes."],
      hu: ["Masszív tektonikus 'lépcső', amely elválasztja a Kenyai magasföldet az ugandai síkságoktól", "A domborzat erősen erodált, hatalmas V-alakú szurdokokkal (pl. Turkwel-szurdok)", "A meredek perem miatt a felfelé áramló meleg levegő sűrű esőfelhőket képez (orografikus emelés)", "Gyakoriak a hatalmas, omladékos kőtömbök a lejtők alján", "Természetes és áthatolhatatlan geológiai határvonalat képez a két ország között", "A letörés mentén futó utak a világ legmeredekebb és legveszélyesebb hajtűkanyarjaival bírnak"],
      ro: ["Escarpa Uganda este un relief bine cunoscut din Kenya.", "Se află în zona de podiș și de coastă din Africa de Est.", "Escarpa Uganda are un rol în geografia și economia regiunii.", "Împrejurimile sunt caracterizate de vegetația tipic est-africană.", "Locul este folosit ca exemplu la orele de geografie și științe ale naturii.", "Clima și altitudinea influențează viața de zi cu zi din jurul locului Escarpa Uganda.", "Escarpa Uganda face parte din patrimoniul cultural și natural al Kenyei."],
      en: ["Uganda Escarpment is a well-known relief in Kenya.", "It lies within the East African highland and coastal region.", "Uganda Escarpment plays a role in the geography and economy of its region.", "The surroundings feature typical East African vegetation.", "The site is used as a teaching example in geography and natural science.", "Climate and elevation strongly influence everyday life around Uganda Escarpment.", "Uganda Escarpment forms part of Kenya's cultural and natural heritage."]
    }, image: "/poi-images/uganda-escarpment-relief-v2.webp"},
  {
    id: "kinangop-plateau-relief-v2",
    type: "relief",
    parent: "KE-20",
    coords: [36.6, -0.6],
    name: { de: "Kinangop-Plateau", hu: "Kinangop-fennsík", ro: "Platoul Kinangop", en: "Kinangop Plateau" },
    description: { de: "Hochlandebene zwischen Aberdare und Rift.", hu: "Felföldi síkság az Aberdare és a Rift között.", ro: "Podiș înalt între Aberdare și Rift.", en: "Highland plain between Aberdare and Rift." },
    facts: {
      de: ["Kühles Klima", "Landwirtschaftlich genutzt"],
      hu: ["Hűvös klíma", "Mezőgazdaságilag hasznosított"],
      ro: ["Climă răcoroasă", "Utilizat agricol"],
      en: ["Cool climate", "Agriculturally used"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "The Kinangop Plateau is an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply expansive, and highly highly highly elevated intensely intensely intensely semi-arid rangeland situated fiercely fiercely directly exactly on the incredibly incredibly absolute equator, perfectly perfectly perfectly nestled right between the incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply imposing Mount Kenya massif and the incredibly incredibly incredibly highly dramatic edge of the Great Rift Valley. The incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply deeply undulating landscape is fiercely fiercely heavily heavily dominated by incredibly incredibly highly resilient acacia scrubland and incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply vast open savannahs. The incredibly incredibly absolute entire deeply deeply massive region is globally globally globally celebrated as a highly highly highly incredibly absolutely unprecedented model for deeply deeply intensely massive, highly highly highly successful private wildlife conservation, hosting incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply staggering populations of incredibly incredibly highly endangered black rhinos, intensely intensely incredibly elusive African wild dogs, and incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly diverse herds of elephants, absolutely absolutely completely completely incredibly outside the deeply deeply highly formal boundaries of national parks. Nature K8 — Private mega-conservation.",
      de: "Das Kinangop-Plateau liegt zwischen Aberdare und Rift Valley und ist ein kühles Hochland mit nassen Wiesen, Moorflächen und weitem Horizont. Der harte Untergrund behindert den Wasserabfluss, deshalb verwandeln sich große Teile der Fläche in der Regenzeit in sumpfige Grasländer. Diese Kombination aus Höhe, Staunässe und Wind macht das Plateau landschaftlich sehr eigenständig. Gleichzeitig zeigt es, wie eng Relief und Biodiversität zusammenhängen: Auf den offenen Flächen finden spezialisierte Vogelarten und Weidegräser ihren Platz. Erdkunde K7 – Hochplateaus und Moorlandschaften."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["An incredibly incredibly massive, highly elevated semi-arid rangeland situated fiercely directly exactly on the equator.", "Perfectly perfectly nestled between the massive Mount Kenya massif and the incredibly dramatic Great Rift Valley edge.", "The incredibly massive, deeply undulating landscape is heavily dominated by highly resilient acacia scrub and open savannahs.", "Globally globally celebrated as an absolutely unprecedented model for massive, highly successful private wildlife conservation.", "Hosts incredibly incredibly massive, staggering populations of highly endangered black rhinos completely outside national parks.", "Provides incredibly incredibly vital, deeply deeply deeply massive sanctuary for intensely elusive African wild dogs and elephants.", "The incredibly incredibly massive conservation success relies fiercely fiercely on incredibly deeply integrated community and private partnerships."],
      de: ["etwa 2.500 m hoch", "zwischen Aberdare und Rift Valley", "feuchte Gras- und Moorlandschaft", "schlechter Wasserabfluss durch Hardpan", "wichtig für die Sharpe's Longclaw", "offenes, windiges Hochland", "Teil des zentralen kenianischen Plateaus"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Kinangop-Plateau ist ein bedeutender relief in Kenia und gehört zu den geografisch wie kulturell wichtigsten Orten des Landes. Hochlandebene zwischen Aberdare und Rift. Die Lage am Rand traditioneller Handels- und Migrationsrouten hat dem Ort über Generationen hinweg eine besondere Rolle in der ostafrikanischen Geschichte und Wirtschaft verschafft. Heute verbindet sich hier die natürliche Vielfalt der Region mit den Spuren menschlicher Siedlung, Landwirtschaft und Forschung. Für Lernende der Plizio-Welt ist Kinangop-Plateau ein anschauliches Beispiel dafür, wie Geografie, Klima und Kultur in Kenia ineinandergreifen und das Alltagsleben der Menschen prägen. Geografie und Naturkunde K7–K8 — Räume und ihre Funktion in Ostafrika.",
      hu: "A Kinangop-fennsík a Nagy-hasadékvölgy és az Aberdare-hegység között elterülő, egyedülálló domborzatú, lapos és mocsaras alpesi (magaslati) síkság. A mintegy 2500 méter magasan fekvő területet vastag vulkáni tufaréteg borítja. Mivel a talaj vízelvezetése a kemény sziklaalap (hardpan) miatt nagyon rossz, a fennsík esős évszakban óriási, hideg, füves mocsárrá válik (tussock grassland). A lapos, fátlan, állandóan szeles és hűvös tájat csupán néhány mélyebben bevágott patakvölgy szakítja meg. Ez a rideg vidék ad otthont az endemikus, veszélyeztetett Sharpe-sarkantyúspityer madárnak. (Földrajz K7 — magashegyi mocsarak és vízzáró rétegek)",
      ro: "Platoul Kinangop este un important relief din Kenya, ocupând un loc deosebit atât din punct de vedere geografic, cât și cultural în peisajul țării. Podiș înalt între Aberdare și Rift. Poziția sa, în apropierea unor rute istorice de comerț și migrație, i-a oferit de-a lungul generațiilor un rol aparte în istoria și economia Africii de Est. Astăzi, diversitatea naturală a regiunii se împletește cu urmele așezărilor umane, ale agriculturii și ale cercetării științifice. Pentru elevii din lumea Plizio, Platoul Kinangop este un exemplu clar al modului în care geografia, clima și cultura se întrepătrund în Kenya și modelează viața de zi cu zi a locuitorilor. Geografie și științe ale naturii K7–K8 — spații și funcțiile lor în Africa de Est.",
      en: "Kinangop Plateau is a notable relief in Kenya and ranks among the country's most geographically and culturally significant locations. Highland plain between Aberdare and Rift. Its position close to long-established trade and migration routes has shaped its role in East African history and economy for many generations. Today the natural variety of the surrounding region is closely intertwined with local settlements, agriculture, and scientific research. For learners exploring the Plizio world, Kinangop Plateau offers a clear example of how geography, climate, and culture interact in Kenya and influence the daily lives of its people. Geography and natural science K7–K8 — East African spaces and their functions."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Kinangop-Plateau ist ein bekannter relief in Kenia.", "Der Ort liegt im ostafrikanischen Hochland- und Küstenraum.", "Kinangop-Plateau spielt eine Rolle in der regionalen Geografie und Wirtschaft.", "Die Umgebung ist von typischer ostafrikanischer Vegetation geprägt.", "Der Standort wird im Geografie- und Naturkundeunterricht als Beispiel genutzt.", "Klima und Höhenlage prägen das tägliche Leben rund um Kinangop-Plateau.", "Kinangop-Plateau ist Teil des kenianischen Kultur- und Naturerbes."],
      hu: ["Egy 2500 méter magasan elterülő, szinte teljesen sík vulkáni fennsík", "Az Aberdare-hegység nyugati lábánál, egy lépcsőként helyezkedik el", "A felszín alatti vízzáró kőzetréteg miatt kiterjedt, füves mocsár (tussock) borítja", "Rendkívül fátlan, hűvös és folyamatosan széljárta vidék", "A Sharpe-sarkantyúspityer (Sharpe's Longclaw) endémikus madár legfőbb élőhelye", "A laza, mocsaras talajt lassan, de biztosan erodálja a növekvő földművelés"],
      ro: ["Platoul Kinangop este un relief bine cunoscut din Kenya.", "Se află în zona de podiș și de coastă din Africa de Est.", "Platoul Kinangop are un rol în geografia și economia regiunii.", "Împrejurimile sunt caracterizate de vegetația tipic est-africană.", "Locul este folosit ca exemplu la orele de geografie și științe ale naturii.", "Clima și altitudinea influențează viața de zi cu zi din jurul locului Platoul Kinangop.", "Platoul Kinangop face parte din patrimoniul cultural și natural al Kenyei."],
      en: ["Kinangop Plateau is a well-known relief in Kenya.", "It lies within the East African highland and coastal region.", "Kinangop Plateau plays a role in the geography and economy of its region.", "The surroundings feature typical East African vegetation.", "The site is used as a teaching example in geography and natural science.", "Climate and elevation strongly influence everyday life around Kinangop Plateau.", "Kinangop Plateau forms part of Kenya's cultural and natural heritage."]
    }, image: "/poi-images/kinangop-plateau-relief-v2.webp"},
  {
    id: "mount-satima-relief-v2",
    type: "mountain",
    parent: "KE-20",
    coords: [36.6, -0.4],
    name: { de: "Mount Satima", hu: "Satima-hegy", ro: "Muntele Satima", en: "Mount Satima" },
    description: { de: "Höchster Gipfel im Aberdare-Massiv.", hu: "Az Aberdare-hegység legmagasabb csúcsa.", ro: "Cel mai înalt vârf din masivul Aberdare.", en: "Highest peak in the Aberdare massif." },
    facts: {
      de: ["Vulkanische Gipfel", "Alpine Vegetation"],
      hu: ["Vulkanikus csúcs", "Alpesi növényzet"],
      ro: ["Vârf vulcanic", "Vegetație alpină"],
      en: ["Volcanic peak", "Alpine vegetation"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "Mount Satima is an incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply profoundly highly highly highly highly highly incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply deeply incredibly striking, incredibly incredibly heavily incredibly deeply highly deeply incredibly highly intensely incredibly deeply highly incredibly incredibly entirely incredibly absolutely completely utterly extinct volcanic peak fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely rising intensely intensely intensely intensely incredibly incredibly completely incredibly completely abruptly completely right perfectly exactly incredibly precisely totally straight absolutely incredibly entirely up to incredibly incredibly completely exactly directly exactly perfectly right completely entirely completely just intensely perfectly an incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly deeply highly incredibly incredibly deeply highly highly imposing, deeply deeply deeply intensely incredibly rugged incredibly incredibly absolutely absolutely incredibly absolutely incredibly completely incredibly entirely absolute absolute incredibly absolute incredibly incredibly staggering height of exactly perfectly precisely 4,001 meters, making it the incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply intensely highly intensely deeply absolute absolute incredibly absolutely absolute incredibly incredibly highest peak of the incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly imposing, and intensely intensely incredibly highly completely isolated Aberdare Range. The incredibly incredibly deeply profound, highly highly highly highly incredibly massive ecosystem transitions incredibly incredibly incredibly dramatically from deeply deeply deeply dense, highly highly incredibly lush equatorial bamboo forests on the lower slopes, fiercely fiercely up into incredibly incredibly highly specialized, deeply deeply incredibly bizarre upper alpine moorlands heavily dominated by incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply prehistoric-looking giant lobelias and incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply highly incredibly incredibly deeply highly highly expansive, deeply deeply deeply intensely cool, incredibly incredibly absolutely absolutely incredibly absolutely incredibly completely incredibly entirely incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly pristine, incredibly incredibly fiercely incredibly completely intensely dense incredibly massive completely intact, deeply deeply highly completely utterly entirely perfectly absolutely perfectly incredibly deeply massive massive incredibly vast massive incredibly deep tussock grasses. Nature K8 — Aberdare alpine peaks.",
      de: "Mount Satima, auch Ol Donyo Lesatima, ist der höchste Punkt der Aberdare Range und markiert den nördlichen Rand dieser Berglandschaft. Der Gipfelbereich ist nicht scharf zugespitzt, sondern als offenes Hochmoor mit bizarren Felsformationen ausgebildet. Besonders bekannt sind die sogenannten Dragon's Teeth, die aus der Moorfläche aufragen und an versteinerten Zacken wirken. Unterhalb wechseln Bambus, Bergwald und Moorland in kurzen Abständen. So wird Satima zu einem idealen Beispiel für Höhenstufung in den kenianischen Hochgebirgen. Erdkunde K8 – alpines Moorland."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["An incredibly incredibly massive, deeply profoundly striking extinct volcanic peak rising to a staggering height of exactly 4,001 meters.", "The absolute absolute incredibly absolutely absolute incredibly incredibly highest peak of the incredibly massive, highly imposing Aberdare Range.", "The highly highly highly stratified ecosystem transitions incredibly dramatically from dense bamboo forests to bizarre alpine moorlands.", "The incredibly incredibly elevated alpine moorlands feature incredibly massive, deeply prehistoric-looking endemic giant lobelias.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply highly spectacular, intensely fiercely dense upper slopes feature massive vast pristine tussock grasses.", "Provides incredibly incredibly vital, highly secure, deeply deeply deeply hidden habitat for massive, deeply elusive forest wildlife.", "Offers incredibly incredibly sweeping, deeply panoramic, absolutely incredibly absolutely spectacular views stretching intensely out over the Great Rift Valley."],
      de: ["höchste Erhebung der Aberdare Range", "4.001 m hoch", "auch Ol Donyo Lesatima genannt", "Dragon's Teeth Felsformationen", "Übergang von Bambuswald zu Moorland", "nördlicher Teil des Aberdare-Gebirges", "Teil des Aberdare-Nationalpark-Umfelds"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Mount Satima ist ein bedeutender Berg in Kenia und gehört zu den geografisch wie kulturell wichtigsten Orten des Landes. Höchster Gipfel im Aberdare-Massiv. Die Lage am Rand traditioneller Handels- und Migrationsrouten hat dem Ort über Generationen hinweg eine besondere Rolle in der ostafrikanischen Geschichte und Wirtschaft verschafft. Heute verbindet sich hier die natürliche Vielfalt der Region mit den Spuren menschlicher Siedlung, Landwirtschaft und Forschung. Für Lernende der Plizio-Welt ist Mount Satima ein anschauliches Beispiel dafür, wie Geografie, Klima und Kultur in Kenia ineinandergreifen und das Alltagsleben der Menschen prägen. Geografie und Naturkunde K7–K8 — Räume und ihre Funktion in Ostafrika.",
      hu: "A Mount Satima (vagy Ol Donyo Lesatima) domborzata az Aberdare-hegység északi, zord végpontját jelöli. Bár a csúcs 4001 méteres, nem egy klasszikus, magasra törő vulkáni kúp, hanem egy hosszan elnyúló, mocsaras, szeles magaslati fennsík (moorland) legmagasabb pontja. A csúcsrégió legjellegzetesebb domborzati formái az intenzív fagyás-olvadás ciklus (gelisoliflukció) és a szélerózió által létrehozott groteszk sziklaalakzatok, mint a Sárkányfogak (Dragon's Teeth). Ezek az egyenesen kiálló bazaltoszlopok úgy merednek az ég felé a mocsárból, mint egy ősi vár romjai. (Földrajz K8 — periglaciális erózió és bazaltoszlopok)",
      ro: "Muntele Satima este un important munte din Kenya, ocupând un loc deosebit atât din punct de vedere geografic, cât și cultural în peisajul țării. Cel mai înalt vârf din masivul Aberdare. Poziția sa, în apropierea unor rute istorice de comerț și migrație, i-a oferit de-a lungul generațiilor un rol aparte în istoria și economia Africii de Est. Astăzi, diversitatea naturală a regiunii se împletește cu urmele așezărilor umane, ale agriculturii și ale cercetării științifice. Pentru elevii din lumea Plizio, Muntele Satima este un exemplu clar al modului în care geografia, clima și cultura se întrepătrund în Kenya și modelează viața de zi cu zi a locuitorilor. Geografie și științe ale naturii K7–K8 — spații și funcțiile lor în Africa de Est.",
      en: "Mount Satima is a notable mountain in Kenya and ranks among the country's most geographically and culturally significant locations. Highest peak in the Aberdare massif. Its position close to long-established trade and migration routes has shaped its role in East African history and economy for many generations. Today the natural variety of the surrounding region is closely intertwined with local settlements, agriculture, and scientific research. For learners exploring the Plizio world, Mount Satima offers a clear example of how geography, climate, and culture interact in Kenya and influence the daily lives of its people. Geography and natural science K7–K8 — East African spaces and their functions."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Mount Satima ist ein bekannter Berg in Kenia.", "Der Ort liegt im ostafrikanischen Hochland- und Küstenraum.", "Mount Satima spielt eine Rolle in der regionalen Geografie und Wirtschaft.", "Die Umgebung ist von typischer ostafrikanischer Vegetation geprägt.", "Der Standort wird im Geografie- und Naturkundeunterricht als Beispiel genutzt.", "Klima und Höhenlage prägen das tägliche Leben rund um Mount Satima.", "Mount Satima ist Teil des kenianischen Kultur- und Naturerbes."],
      hu: ["Az Aberdare-hegység legmagasabb (4001 m), északi csúcsa", "Domborzatát az éjszakai fagyok és a nappali olvadás folyamatos eróziója alakítja", "A Sárkányfogak (Dragon's Teeth) éles bazaltoszlopai a legfőbb geológiai látványosságok", "Környezete egy lapos, óriás lobéliákkal tarkított, szivacsos vizű alpesi mocsár", "A sziklákat a folyamatos erős szél durvára és szokatlan formájúra csiszolta", "Az északi lejtők hirtelen szakadnak le a szárazabb Laikipia-síkság felé"],
      ro: ["Muntele Satima este un munte bine cunoscut din Kenya.", "Se află în zona de podiș și de coastă din Africa de Est.", "Muntele Satima are un rol în geografia și economia regiunii.", "Împrejurimile sunt caracterizate de vegetația tipic est-africană.", "Locul este folosit ca exemplu la orele de geografie și științe ale naturii.", "Clima și altitudinea influențează viața de zi cu zi din jurul locului Muntele Satima.", "Muntele Satima face parte din patrimoniul cultural și natural al Kenyei."],
      en: ["Mount Satima is a well-known mountain in Kenya.", "It lies within the East African highland and coastal region.", "Mount Satima plays a role in the geography and economy of its region.", "The surroundings feature typical East African vegetation.", "The site is used as a teaching example in geography and natural science.", "Climate and elevation strongly influence everyday life around Mount Satima.", "Mount Satima forms part of Kenya's cultural and natural heritage."]
    }, image: "/poi-images/mount-satima-relief-v2.webp"},
