    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "Ndere Island is a deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly highly intensely incredibly intensely deeply serene, highly highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply highly incredibly specialized, highly highly highly highly incredibly incredibly intensely incredibly incredibly highly deeply deeply deeply highly shallow alkaline lake fiercely fiercely fiercely intensely intensely intensely located deeply deeply exactly perfectly exactly absolutely perfectly precisely right perfectly completely precisely between the incredibly incredibly massive, highly highly highly intensely deeply highly intensely bustling urban centers of deeply deeply incredibly incredibly highly highly massive Naivasha and deeply deeply incredibly deeply highly massive Nakuru. The incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply intensely highly intensely deeply alkaline waters incredibly incredibly highly frequently incredibly completely frequently completely totally heavily frequently host incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply stunning, highly highly highly incredibly highly massive populations of incredibly incredibly incredibly specialized deeply deeply pink flamingos and absolutely absolute incredibly massive, deeply deeply intensely intensely fiercely noisy colonies of incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply intensely deeply deeply highly elegant great white pelicans. The deeply deeply intensely intensely incredibly stark, highly highly highly highly highly incredibly intensely incredibly harsh surrounding landscape is fiercely fiercely fiercely heavily heavily intensely intensely absolutely heavily highly incredibly incredibly heavily dominated absolutely entirely totally completely by the incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly imposing, incredibly incredibly heavily eroded, highly highly highly incredibly deeply incredibly sharp volcanic profile of the deeply deeply deeply incredibly massive, absolutely absolutely incredibly highly incredibly famous Sleeping Warrior hill. Nature K7 — Rift Valley bird sanctuaries.",
      de: "Ndere Island liegt im Winam Gulf des Viktoriasees und ist trotz ihrer geringen Größe ein klar abgegrenzter Reliefkörper. Die Insel besteht aus Fels und Hängen, die steil aus dem Wasser aufsteigen und nur wenige flachere Uferzonen lassen. Dadurch entstehen geschützte Buchten, in denen Vögel, Flusspferde und andere Tiere den Uferraum nutzen. Für die Region ist die Insel ein Beispiel dafür, wie selbst kleine harte Gesteinskörper die Küstenlinie und die Nutzung eines Sees prägen können. Erdkunde K6 – Inselrelief in Seen."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["A deeply deeply incredibly serene, highly incredibly specialized shallow alkaline lake located exactly between Naivasha and Nakuru.", "The incredibly incredibly deeply alkaline waters frequently host incredibly massive, deeply stunning populations of specialized pink flamingos.", "Absolutely absolutely incredibly heavily supports massive, deeply intensely noisy colonies of highly elegant great white pelicans.", "The intensely intensely incredibly stark, highly harsh surrounding landscape is fiercely dominated by a deeply imposing volcanic profile.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, heavily eroded volcanic hill is absolutely incredibly famous globally as the Sleeping Warrior.", "The deeply deeply highly fragile, incredibly incredibly shallow ecosystem is intensely heavily protected as a vital Ramsar wetland.", "Provides incredibly incredibly incredibly crucial, deeply deeply deeply safe breeding grounds for massive massive migratory bird species."],
      de: ["liegt im Winam Gulf des Lake Victoria", "Ndere Island National Park", "Fläche rund 4,2 km²", "Schutzgebiet für Vögel, Hippos und Krokodile", "Felsinsel mit steilen Ufern", "nahe Kisumu", "Teil des Viktoriaseesystems"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Ndere-Insel ist ein bedeutender Berg in Kenia und gehört zu den geografisch wie kulturell wichtigsten Orten des Landes. Hügelige Insel im Viktoriasee. Die Lage am Rand traditioneller Handels- und Migrationsrouten hat dem Ort über Generationen hinweg eine besondere Rolle in der ostafrikanischen Geschichte und Wirtschaft verschafft. Heute verbindet sich hier die natürliche Vielfalt der Region mit den Spuren menschlicher Siedlung, Landwirtschaft und Forschung. Für Lernende der Plizio-Welt ist Ndere-Insel ein anschauliches Beispiel dafür, wie Geografie, Klima und Kultur in Kenia ineinandergreifen und das Alltagsleben der Menschen prägen. Geografie und Naturkunde K7–K8 — Räume und ihre Funktion in Ostafrika.",
      hu: "A Ndere-sziget a Viktória-tó Winam-öblének geológiai szempontból lenyűgöző domborzati formája. Ez a kis sziget lényegében egy meredek, vulkáni kőzetekből (bazalt és riolit) felépülő sziklatömb, amely élesen kiemelkedik a tó nyugodt felszínéből. Domborzatára a sziklás, omladékos partvonalak és a sziget közepén húzódó, sűrű cserjékkel és magas, szavannai fűvel borított gerinc a jellemző. A sekély parti vizek és a védett sziklaöblök kiváló élőhelyet biztosítanak a tó krokodiljainak, vízilovainak és a hatalmas varánusz gyíkoknak. (Földrajz K6 — tavi szigetek és vulkáni maradványok)",
      ro: "Insula Ndere este un important munte din Kenya, ocupând un loc deosebit atât din punct de vedere geografic, cât și cultural în peisajul țării. Insulă deluroasă în Lacul Victoria. Poziția sa, în apropierea unor rute istorice de comerț și migrație, i-a oferit de-a lungul generațiilor un rol aparte în istoria și economia Africii de Est. Astăzi, diversitatea naturală a regiunii se împletește cu urmele așezărilor umane, ale agriculturii și ale cercetării științifice. Pentru elevii din lumea Plizio, Insula Ndere este un exemplu clar al modului în care geografia, clima și cultura se întrepătrund în Kenya și modelează viața de zi cu zi a locuitorilor. Geografie și științe ale naturii K7–K8 — spații și funcțiile lor în Africa de Est.",
      en: "Ndere Island is a notable mountain in Kenya and ranks among the country's most geographically and culturally significant locations. Hilly island in Lake Victoria. Its position close to long-established trade and migration routes has shaped its role in East African history and economy for many generations. Today the natural variety of the surrounding region is closely intertwined with local settlements, agriculture, and scientific research. For learners exploring the Plizio world, Ndere Island offers a clear example of how geography, climate, and culture interact in Kenya and influence the daily lives of its people. Geography and natural science K7–K8 — East African spaces and their functions."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Ndere-Insel ist ein bekannter Berg in Kenia.", "Der Ort liegt im ostafrikanischen Hochland- und Küstenraum.", "Ndere-Insel spielt eine Rolle in der regionalen Geografie und Wirtschaft.", "Die Umgebung ist von typischer ostafrikanischer Vegetation geprägt.", "Der Standort wird im Geografie- und Naturkundeunterricht als Beispiel genutzt.", "Klima und Höhenlage prägen das tägliche Leben rund um Ndere-Insel.", "Ndere-Insel ist Teil des kenianischen Kultur- und Naturerbes."],
      hu: ["A Viktória-tó kenyai részén (Winam-öböl) fekvő meredek sziklás sziget", "Kemény vulkáni kőzetből (bazalt, riolit) áll, amely ellenállt a tó hullámzásának", "Lakatlan (csak a vadőrök élnek ott), így a domborzat teljesen érintetlen", "Meredek sziklás partjai miatt nehezen kikötőhely, természetes védelmet nyújt a hüllőknek", "A sziget gerincéről panorámás kilátás nyílik Homa Bay-re és Kisumura", "A nevét a helyi luo nyelvből kapta, ami 'találkozóhelyet' jelent"],
      ro: ["Insula Ndere este un munte bine cunoscut din Kenya.", "Se află în zona de podiș și de coastă din Africa de Est.", "Insula Ndere are un rol în geografia și economia regiunii.", "Împrejurimile sunt caracterizate de vegetația tipic est-africană.", "Locul este folosit ca exemplu la orele de geografie și științe ale naturii.", "Clima și altitudinea influențează viața de zi cu zi din jurul locului Insula Ndere.", "Insula Ndere face parte din patrimoniul cultural și natural al Kenyei."],
      en: ["Ndere Island is a well-known mountain in Kenya.", "It lies within the East African highland and coastal region.", "Ndere Island plays a role in the geography and economy of its region.", "The surroundings feature typical East African vegetation.", "The site is used as a teaching example in geography and natural science.", "Climate and elevation strongly influence everyday life around Ndere Island.", "Ndere Island forms part of Kenya's cultural and natural heritage."]
