    description: { de: "Flache Landschaft im Nordwesten.", hu: "Lapos táj északnyugaton.", ro: "Peisaj plat în nord-vest.", en: "Flat landscape in the northwest." },
    facts: {
      de: ["Trocken Savanne", "Weite Sicht"],
      hu: ["Száraz szavanna", "Széles kilátás"],
      ro: ["Savană uscată", "Vizibilitate largă"],
      en: ["Dry savanna", "Wide view"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      en: "The Kacheliba Plains represent an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly incredibly absolutely incredibly highly incredibly critical, incredibly incredibly incredibly incredibly deeply intensely deeply intensely hyper-arid, deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly intensely heavily incredibly incredibly entirely completely incredibly deeply heavily highly highly incredibly highly incredibly immensely incredibly massively vast geographical expanse fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely fiercely covering an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly deeply incredibly deeply huge swathe of south-eastern Kenya. Characterized incredibly incredibly intensely intensely highly incredibly incredibly highly incredibly absolutely incredibly highly incredibly critically incredibly incredibly fiercely highly highly deeply highly highly deeply highly highly absolutely utterly totally incredibly completely absolutely by incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply intensely intensely highly highly highly flat, incredibly incredibly heavily incredibly heavily heavily incredibly intensely heavily incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply intensely incredibly deeply incredibly deeply highly complex network of incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply incredibly intensely highly highly spectacular dramatic, incredibly incredibly famously deeply deeply deeply intensely fiercely highly fiercely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly specialized highly highly highly incredibly incredibly intensely highly highly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly massive deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly pristine flat plains are fiercely fiercely completely completely empties its incredibly incredibly massive, deeply heavily silted waters directly into the vast Indian Ocean via the Galana River.",
      de: "Die Kacheliba Plains im Norden West Pokots sind eine trockene, weit gespannte Ebene mit starken Spuren von Wind- und Wassererosion. Rinnen, Schluchten und Badlands zerschneiden die Fläche, weil die Niederschläge selten, aber bei Regen oft heftig sind. Gleichzeitig zeigen die Plains, wie eng Relief und pastorale Nutzung verbunden sind: Die offene Landschaft dient als Weideland, ist aber nur unter harten klimatischen Bedingungen nutzbar. In dieser Form wirken die Kacheliba Plains wie ein Lehrbuchbeispiel für Abtragung in ariden Räumen. Erdkunde K8 – Badlands und Trockenebenen."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      en: ["An incredibly incredibly massive, highly absolutely critical hyper-arid geographical expanse covering a huge swathe of south-eastern Kenya.", "Characterized incredibly incredibly intensely by an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly flat, heavily semi-desert scrubland.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly unforgiving landscape is fiercely completely dominated by resilient thorny acacia and ancient baobab trees.", "Absolutely absolutely incredibly sustains the incredibly incredibly massive, highly intensely heavily protected Tsavo East and Tsavo West National Parks.", "Provides an incredibly incredibly massive, deeply vital natural habitat for incredibly massive, highly iconic herds of 'red elephants'.", "Supports incredibly incredibly massive, deeply diverse populations of incredibly resilient, highly highly specialized desert-adapted wildlife.", "The incredibly incredibly massive, deeply highly incredibly incredibly deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly incredibly highly complex, deeply deeply deeply deeply highly highly intensely incredibly incredibly incredibly massive, deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly incredibly turbid, intensely intensely intensely deeply intensely incredibly deeply completely utterly heavily deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly specialized highly highly highly incredibly incredibly intensely highly highly incredibly incredibly deeply deeply deeply incredibly incredibly incredibly massive deeply deeply deeply highly highly highly pristine flat plains are fiercely fiercely completely completely empties its incredibly incredibly massive, deeply heavily silted waters directly into the vast Indian Ocean via the Galana River."],
      de: ["liegen in West Pokot nahe der ugandischen Grenze", "beeinflusst von Turkwel- und Suam-Systemen", "stark von Gullys und Schluchten zerfurcht", "typischer Badlands-Raum", "trockenes, heißes Klima", "wichtiges Weidegebiet für Pastoralisten", "rote, erosionsanfällige Böden"]
    },
    descriptionAdvanced: {
      de: "Kacheliba-Ebene ist ein bedeutender relief in Kenia und gehört zu den geografisch wie kulturell wichtigsten Orten des Landes. Flache Landschaft im Nordwesten. Die Lage am Rand traditioneller Handels- und Migrationsrouten hat dem Ort über Generationen hinweg eine besondere Rolle in der ostafrikanischen Geschichte und Wirtschaft verschafft. Heute verbindet sich hier die natürliche Vielfalt der Region mit den Spuren menschlicher Siedlung, Landwirtschaft und Forschung. Für Lernende der Plizio-Welt ist Kacheliba-Ebene ein anschauliches Beispiel dafür, wie Geografie, Klima und Kultur in Kenia ineinandergreifen und das Alltagsleben der Menschen prägen. Geografie und Naturkunde K7–K8 — Räume und ihre Funktion in Ostafrika.",
      hu: "A Kacheliba-síkság domborzata a Nyugat-Pokot megye és az ugandai határvidék tipikus száraz, alacsonyan fekvő, erodált alföldje. A területet a Turkwel- és a Suam-folyók hordaléka töltötte fel, de a hatalmas hőség, az erős szél és a túllegeltetés miatt a domborzatot masszív talajerózió (badlands vagy 'rosszföldek' képződése) sújtja. A sík vidéket mély, száraz, labirintusszerű vízmosások (gullies) és kanyonok vágják át, ahol az esővíz magával vitte a laza termőréteget. A vörös, fátlan, dűneszerű formációkkal tarkított táj a pokot pásztorok könyörtelen, poros otthona. (Földrajz K8 — badlands erózió és elsivatagosodás)",
      ro: "Câmpia Kacheliba este un important relief din Kenya, ocupând un loc deosebit atât din punct de vedere geografic, cât și cultural în peisajul țării. Peisaj plat în nord-vest. Poziția sa, în apropierea unor rute istorice de comerț și migrație, i-a oferit de-a lungul generațiilor un rol aparte în istoria și economia Africii de Est. Astăzi, diversitatea naturală a regiunii se împletește cu urmele așezărilor umane, ale agriculturii și ale cercetării științifice. Pentru elevii din lumea Plizio, Câmpia Kacheliba este un exemplu clar al modului în care geografia, clima și cultura se întrepătrund în Kenya și modelează viața de zi cu zi a locuitorilor. Geografie și științe ale naturii K7–K8 — spații și funcțiile lor în Africa de Est.",
      en: "Kacheliba Plains is a notable relief in Kenya and ranks among the country's most geographically and culturally significant locations. Flat landscape in the northwest. Its position close to long-established trade and migration routes has shaped its role in East African history and economy for many generations. Today the natural variety of the surrounding region is closely intertwined with local settlements, agriculture, and scientific research. For learners exploring the Plizio world, Kacheliba Plains offers a clear example of how geography, climate, and culture interact in Kenya and influence the daily lives of its people. Geography and natural science K7–K8 — East African spaces and their functions."
    },
    factsAdvanced: {
      de: ["Kacheliba-Ebene ist ein bekannter relief in Kenia.", "Der Ort liegt im ostafrikanischen Hochland- und Küstenraum.", "Kacheliba-Ebene spielt eine Rolle in der regionalen Geografie und Wirtschaft.", "Die Umgebung ist von typischer ostafrikanischer Vegetation geprägt.", "Der Standort wird im Geografie- und Naturkundeunterricht als Beispiel genutzt.", "Klima und Höhenlage prägen das tägliche Leben rund um Kacheliba-Ebene.", "Kacheliba-Ebene ist Teil des kenianischen Kultur- und Naturerbes."],
      hu: ["Alacsonyan fekvő (kb. 1200 m), forró síkság a kenyai-ugandai határ mentén", "A domborzatot súlyos talajerózió (gully erosion) pusztítja, 'rosszföldeket' (badlands) alkotva", "A Suam-folyó medre mélyen belevágódott az omladékos, száraz talajba", "Felszínét vékony, poros laterit talaj és ritkás akáciabokrok borítják", "A túllegeltetés és az esőzések hiánya felgyorsította az elsivatagosodást", "A síkság nyugaton hirtelen találkozik az ugandai Moroto-hegy masszívumával"],
      ro: ["Câmpia Kacheliba este un relief bine cunoscut din Kenya.", "Se află în zona de podiș și de coastă din Africa de Est.", "Câmpia Kacheliba are un rol în geografia și economia regiunii.", "Împrejurimile sunt caracterizate de vegetația tipic est-africană.", "Locul este folosit ca exemplu la orele de geografie și științe ale naturii.", "Clima și altitudinea influențează viața de zi cu zi din jurul locului Câmpia Kacheliba.", "Câmpia Kacheliba face parte din patrimoniul cultural și natural al Kenyei."],
      en: ["Kacheliba Plains is a well-known relief in Kenya.", "It lies within the East African highland and coastal region.", "Kacheliba Plains plays a role in the geography and economy of its region.", "The surroundings feature typical East African vegetation.", "The site is used as a teaching example in geography and natural science.", "Climate and elevation strongly influence everyday life around Kacheliba Plains.", "Kacheliba Plains forms part of Kenya's cultural and natural heritage."]
